<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.000" end="00:00:05.600" style="s2">I&#39;m itching like crazy. What is with</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.900" end="00:00:08.100" style="s2">these mosquitoes? They&#39;re eating me</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.600" end="00:00:08.100" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.800" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Man, if that girl could give me a couple</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.400" end="00:00:17.700" style="s2">scratches,</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.600" end="00:00:19.100" style="s2">that&#39;d feel amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.700" end="00:00:20.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.100" end="00:00:22.100" style="s2">Did I hear that right? That Siberian</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.700" end="00:00:23.800" style="s2">tiger is talking?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.100" end="00:00:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. I can understand this human</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.800" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">too? What the hell is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.600" end="00:00:28.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hearing things.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.200" end="00:00:30.400" style="s2">I really can understand animals all of a</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.500" end="00:00:32.599" style="s2">sudden. Want me to</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.400" end="00:00:34.900" style="s2">scratch you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.599" end="00:00:37.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Come on, girl. I swear I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.900" end="00:00:38.400" style="s2">behave. I won&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.200" end="00:00:39.700" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.400" end="00:00:43.600" style="s2">That crazy tiger is too close to the</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.700" end="00:00:43.600" style="s2">bars. It could freak out and attack.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.800" end="00:00:47.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. I&#39;m just trying to scratch an</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.000" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">itch, and he&#39;s already pulling out the</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.500" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">hardware.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.800" end="00:00:56.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.400" end="00:00:57.500" style="s2">Stay away from that crazy tiger before</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.200" end="00:01:00.200" style="s2">it hurts you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:01:02.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Mike, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.200" end="00:01:03.600" style="s2">I came because I need a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.000" end="00:01:05.100" style="s2">I want a big animal to be the face of my</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.600" end="00:01:06.100" style="s2">zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.100" end="00:01:08.700" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.100" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">I&#39;ve only got 50 grand left.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.700" end="00:01:11.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 grand for a big predator? Around</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.600" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">here, that wouldn&#39;t even buy our</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.600" end="00:01:16.000" style="s2">cheapest black wolf.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:18.600" style="s2">If 50 grand is really all you&#39;ve got,</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:20.600" style="s2">there is one option.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:22.100" style="s2">That crazy tiger behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.600" end="00:01:24.300" style="s2">I paid over a million dollars to bring</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.100" end="00:01:25.900" style="s2">this Siberian tiger in for breeding, but</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.300" end="00:01:27.900" style="s2">he&#39;s so aggressive nobody can handle</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.900" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">him. He&#39;s already injured several animal</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.900" end="00:01:30.800" style="s2">behavior trainers.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.400" end="00:01:31.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you humans whispering about?</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.800" end="00:01:34.800" style="s2">I&#39;m just itching like hell. How does</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.900" end="00:01:34.800" style="s2">that make me crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:40.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Mike, don&#39;t do anything yet.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.700" end="00:01:42.000" style="s2">He&#39;s not crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.100" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">You all think he&#39;s a mad tiger. To me,</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.000" end="00:01:46.600" style="s2">he&#39;s no different from a giant house</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.300" end="00:01:49.000" style="s2">cat. Don&#39;t believe me? Watch.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.600" end="00:01:50.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, are you insane? Get back here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.000" end="00:01:52.200" style="s2">You really think a wild predator is a</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.400" end="00:01:54.700" style="s2">house cat? One bite and you can kiss</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.200" end="00:01:56.500" style="s2">that hand goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.700" end="00:01:59.500" style="s2">A little lower. Yeah, right behind the</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.500" end="00:02:00.292" style="s2">ear. I&#39;ve been itching out of my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.500" end="00:02:03.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay,</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.292" end="00:02:05.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; whatever you say. Right here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.192" end="00:02:07.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes, right there. Harder.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.692" end="00:02:08.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t attack her? He&#39;s actually</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:10.292" style="s2">letting her pet him?</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.592" end="00:02:11.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve had this Siberian tiger for years</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.292" end="00:02:12.792" style="s2">and gone through seven or eight</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.392" end="00:02:15.992" style="s2">trainers. He&#39;s never been this close to</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.792" end="00:02:18.092" style="s2">anyone. Impossible. He&#39;s only calm for</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.992" end="00:02:21.292" style="s2">the moment. A wild animal can turn on</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.092" end="00:02:21.292" style="s2">you anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.592" end="00:02:23.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mike Reynolds,</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.892" end="00:02:28.392" style="s2">please have someone bring the truck</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.892" end="00:02:28.392" style="s2">around. $50,000. I&#39;ll take the tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.492" end="00:02:31.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:32.292" style="s2">If you really know how to care for him,</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.192" end="00:02:33.892" style="s2">he&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.292" end="00:02:35.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can buy him, but you can&#39;t take him</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.892" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">out of here. If that crazy tiger attacks</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.892" end="00:02:40.192" style="s2">a visitor, who&#39;s responsible?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.992" end="00:02:42.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An animal has a problem, and your first</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.192" end="00:02:44.592" style="s2">instinct isn&#39;t to find out why,</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.292" end="00:02:47.392" style="s2">it&#39;s to call him crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.592" end="00:02:50.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I follow the proper care standards.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.392" end="00:02:52.992" style="s2">We spray water to cool him down, run the</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.292" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">missiles all day, and keep up with food</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.992" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">and sanitation.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.792" end="00:02:59.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your standard? The floor never</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.592" end="00:03:01.692" style="s2">dries, and there&#39;s standing water in the</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.992" end="00:03:03.692" style="s2">corners. [snorts] The south is already</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.692" end="00:03:05.192" style="s2">more humid than the north. A Siberian</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.692" end="00:03:06.392" style="s2">tiger isn&#39;t built for this climate, and</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.192" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">you&#39;re spraying water and running</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.392" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">missiles every day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.592" end="00:03:14.292" style="s2">You&#39;re basically building a mosquito</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.892" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">nursery.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.292" end="00:03:17.892" style="s2">He gets bitten even when he sleeps.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.092" end="00:03:21.192" style="s2">When he itches, all he can do is rub</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.692" end="00:03:22.892" style="s2">against the bars until the wounds get</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.192" end="00:03:25.017" style="s2">worse and you scare him with electric</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.892" end="00:03:26.092" style="s2">prods.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.017" end="00:03:28.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.092" end="00:03:31.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if there are mosquitoes,</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.192" end="00:03:33.092" style="s2">that shouldn&#39;t make him act like this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.392" end="00:03:34.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.092" end="00:03:35.892" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you move in there and try it?</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.792" end="00:03:38.392" style="s2">See how you like getting bitten from</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.892" end="00:03:40.292" style="s2">head to toe every single day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.392" end="00:03:42.392" style="s2">Uncle Mike, could you get me some wound</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.292" end="00:03:43.792" style="s2">cleaning supplies, insect repellent, a</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.392" end="00:03:46.092" style="s2">hose, and a blower?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.792" end="00:03:48.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get you the supplies, but Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.092" end="00:03:49.992" style="s2">what are you planning to do?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.092" end="00:03:51.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going into the enclosure.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:53.792" style="s2">I&#39;m going to wash him, clean the wounds,</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.892" end="00:03:57.692" style="s2">and medicate them so this so-called</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.792" end="00:03:57.692" style="s2">expert can see just how wrong he is.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.892" end="00:04:03.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re really going in?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.592" end="00:04:04.794" style="s2">No sedation, no separation?</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.694" end="00:04:07.694" style="s2">You want to walk straight into a</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.794" end="00:04:07.694" style="s2">predator enclosure?</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.594" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to put him through the</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.394" end="00:04:12.694" style="s2">stress of sedation</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:14.494" style="s2">when it isn&#39;t necessary.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.694" end="00:04:15.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you treating him</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.494" end="00:04:17.494" style="s2">or trying to get yourself killed? If</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.894" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">something happens in there, nobody can</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.494" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">save you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.394" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Max, I&#39;m going to bathe you and put</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.394" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">medicine on those wounds. Behave</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:29.794" style="s2">yourself, got it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:30.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Come on in. I promise I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.794" end="00:04:32.094" style="s2">touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.994" end="00:04:34.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That girl is going into the tiger</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.094" end="00:04:35.758" style="s2">enclosure by herself with a hose? Is she</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:37.194" style="s2">seriously going to give him a bath?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.758" end="00:04:38.694" style="s2">[gasps] I give her 3 minutes. No, 30</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.194" end="00:04:40.194" style="s2">seconds before he pounces.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.694" end="00:04:41.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the tranquilizer gun ready. The</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.194" end="00:04:45.294" style="s2">second that Siberian tiger makes an</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.694" end="00:04:45.294" style="s2">aggressive move, get her out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.694" end="00:04:48.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still. Let me check the water</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.994" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">temperature first.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.994" end="00:04:51.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:54.094" style="s2">Hit my back, too.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.594" end="00:04:56.594" style="s2">I can feel those bugs washing off.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.094" end="00:04:59.094" style="s2">That&#39;s the stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.594" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">You really get me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.094" end="00:05:02.494" style="s2">A little lower? Yeah, it itches there,</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:04.694" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.494" end="00:05:07.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god, why is that tiger taking a bath</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:07.894" style="s2">like somebody&#39;s house cat?</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.094" end="00:05:15.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she just hit a tiger and a crazy</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.794" end="00:05:17.294" style="s2">tiger at that? Is she out of her mind?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.494" end="00:05:18.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, rolling around, those wounds haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:19.494" style="s2">healed. You get dirty water in them and</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.594" end="00:05:20.994" style="s2">they&#39;ll get infected.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.494" end="00:05:21.608" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay, you don&#39;t have to hit so</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.994" end="00:05:22.394" style="s2">hard.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.608" end="00:05:24.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.394" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who even is she? This isn&#39;t animal</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.094" end="00:05:26.894" style="s2">training. It&#39;s like that tiger knows</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.494" end="00:05:28.394" style="s2">she&#39;s the boss.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.894" end="00:05:29.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go for it. I can take it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.394" end="00:05:30.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hang in there. Cleaning the wounds might</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.694" end="00:05:33.894" style="s2">sting a little.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.994" end="00:05:35.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ooh, this stuff is cool. Feels amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.894" end="00:05:36.794" style="s2">How about another couple layers?</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.194" end="00:05:38.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More medicine</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.794" end="00:05:40.694" style="s2">won&#39;t make it work better.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.594" end="00:05:42.394" style="s2">How do you feel now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.694" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Way better.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.394" end="00:05:46.394" style="s2">Come on, give me some more.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.694" end="00:05:47.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t push your luck. If you rub that</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.394" end="00:05:49.894" style="s2">medicine off, you&#39;re going to hear it</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.594" end="00:05:49.894" style="s2">from me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.994" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a Siberian tiger. That&#39;s an</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.994" end="00:05:56.194" style="s2">oversized ragdoll cat.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.094" end="00:05:57.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See it now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.194" end="00:05:59.094" style="s2">He&#39;s not crazy. You just never bothered</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.594" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">to figure out why he was miserable.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.094" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve run zoos for decades and I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:03.194" style="s2">seen anyone get a full-grown Siberian</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:04.494" style="s2">tiger to behave like this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.194" end="00:06:04.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, Uncle Mike,</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.494" end="00:06:06.995" style="s2">can you</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.695" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sell him to me now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.995" end="00:06:10.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.495" end="00:06:12.295" style="s2">Same price we agreed on. We&#39;ll sign the</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.795" end="00:06:13.695" style="s2">contract in a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.295" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">Emma, I&#39;m trusting Max to you from now</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.695" end="00:06:16.095" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.495" end="00:06:19.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Mike Reynolds.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.095" end="00:06:19.195" style="s2">I&#39;ll take good care of Max.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.195" end="00:06:29.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This crappy truck nearly shook my bones</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.495" end="00:06:30.795" style="s2">apart. So this is my new home?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.495" end="00:06:33.695" style="s2">Why does your place look even rougher</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.795" end="00:06:33.695" style="s2">than the last one?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:38.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a little run down right now, so</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.695" end="00:06:40.095" style="s2">bear with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.095" end="00:06:42.195" style="s2">Once we start making money, I promise</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.095" end="00:06:44.395" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you a much nicer home.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.195" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is my new place ready yet? I&#39;m going</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.395" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">crazy stuck in this cage.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.695" end="00:06:52.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.995" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">I cleaned out the old predator habitat</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.395" end="00:06:55.295" style="s2">for you. I put in a heavy duty</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.695" end="00:06:56.995" style="s2">dehumidifier and cleaned the floor so</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.295" end="00:06:58.095" style="s2">mosquitoes won&#39;t bother you too hot. And</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.995" end="00:07:00.595" style="s2">if it&#39;s a pool next door, you can jump</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.095" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">into it whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.595" end="00:07:04.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? No more getting chewed up by</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.795" end="00:07:06.895" style="s2">those damn little bugs? Now that&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.895" end="00:07:09.795" style="s2">I&#39;m talking about. Let me out. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.895" end="00:07:09.795" style="s2">see it right now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.295" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">That old place was so damp I could</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.995" end="00:07:22.395" style="s2">barely breathe. No standing water here,</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.095" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">no mosquitoes. This is way better. You</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.395" end="00:07:26.495" style="s2">really do get me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.695" end="00:07:28.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re happy with the place,</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.495" end="00:07:29.095" style="s2">it&#39;s time to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.025" end="00:07:30.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.095" end="00:07:32.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does that smell so familiar? Hurry</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.795" end="00:07:34.495" style="s2">up. Let me try one.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.895" end="00:07:35.195" style="s2">That taste. Wait, is this real free</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.495" end="00:07:36.395" style="s2">range farm chicken?</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.195" end="00:07:36.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good eye. I raise these chicken myself.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.395" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">They&#39;re fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.895" end="00:07:39.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fresh chicken beats those frozen birds</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.295" end="00:07:41.895" style="s2">any day. Now give me a big old hen with</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.795" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">some butter on it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.895" end="00:07:44.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re getting picky now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">With our budget, you&#39;re lucky I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.895" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">keeping you full.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.095" end="00:07:51.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, one more.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.995" end="00:07:54.295" style="s2">That last one barely filled the gap</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.395" end="00:07:54.295" style="s2">between my teeth.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.495" end="00:07:59.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spent the last of my money buying you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.595" end="00:08:02.085" style="s2">The zoo opens tomorrow, so you&#39;d better</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.695" end="00:08:02.495" style="s2">put on a good show.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.085" end="00:08:04.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.495" end="00:08:06.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. One look at me and those</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.495" end="00:08:08.697" style="s2">humans won&#39;t be able to walk away.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.795" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Whether this zoo survives</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.697" end="00:08:12.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; or not is up to the two of us now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.297" end="00:08:14.897" style="s2">Hey, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.497" end="00:08:16.697" style="s2">I&#39;m travel blogger Lily Parker.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.897" end="00:08:17.997" style="s2">I check out those little places nobody</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.697" end="00:08:19.597" style="s2">talks about.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.997" end="00:08:21.297" style="s2">This zoo used to be popular, but</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.597" end="00:08:23.297" style="s2">business went downhill, and apparently</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.297" end="00:08:25.397" style="s2">they even sold off a lot of the animals.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.297" end="00:08:26.997" style="s2">So today I&#39;m blowing a whole 10 bucks to</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.397" end="00:08:28.497" style="s2">find out if this place is actually worth</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.997" end="00:08:30.597" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.497" end="00:08:31.897" style="s2">Well, we&#39;re already here, so let&#39;s look</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.597" end="00:08:34.597" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.897" end="00:08:36.697" style="s2">Monkey house, no monkeys. Bear house, no</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.597" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">bears.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.697" end="00:08:40.997" style="s2">Looks like my followers were right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.697" end="00:08:42.097" style="s2">There really aren&#39;t many animals left.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.997" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">To whoever just said they wanted to see</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.097" end="00:08:46.897" style="s2">chickens, congratulations. Your wish has</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:46.897" style="s2">been granted.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.097" end="00:08:52.797" style="s2">Wait, they actually still have a</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.997" end="00:08:54.797" style="s2">predator house? That sign looks brand</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.797" end="00:08:56.397" style="s2">new though.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.797" end="00:08:59.897" style="s2">If it&#39;s just a big yellow dog in there,</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.397" end="00:08:59.897" style="s2">I&#39;ll ask for a refund on your behalf.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.997" end="00:09:05.397" style="s2">That does not sound like a dog. There</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.297" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">might actually be something big in</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.397" end="00:09:10.497" style="s2">there. Don&#39;t go anywhere. We&#39;re about to</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.297" end="00:09:10.497" style="s2">find out what they&#39;re hiding inside.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.897" end="00:09:15.597" style="s2">It&#39;s actually pretty dry over here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.997" end="00:09:16.997" style="s2">Not nearly as humid as outside.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.597" end="00:09:18.497" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.997" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">No snatching.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.497" end="00:09:22.297" style="s2">You grab for it, you don&#39;t get another</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.997" end="00:09:22.297" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:28.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it to me. I&#39;m starving over here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.497" end="00:09:30.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a Siberian tiger? And why is</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.797" end="00:09:32.297" style="s2">that girl in there with him?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.697" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">Back up. Your head is practically inside</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.297" end="00:09:35.097" style="s2">the bucket. It hit the ground. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.097" end="00:09:36.397" style="s2">eat it now. It&#39;s dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.097" end="00:09:37.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a little dirt. Shake it off</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.397" end="00:09:38.597" style="s2">and it&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:41.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get sick and the vet bill alone will</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.597" end="00:09:43.097" style="s2">cost me thousands. Behave yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.397" end="00:09:44.897" style="s2">Oh no, big predators get super</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.097" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">protective around food. That girl&#39;s in</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:48.497" style="s2">trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:50.097" style="s2">I&#39;m stopping you from eating dirty food</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.497" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">and now you&#39;re giving me attitude.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.097" end="00:09:53.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;ll get sick just because</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.597" end="00:09:55.497" style="s2">I eat it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.497" end="00:09:57.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said no, so no. What part of that</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.497" end="00:09:59.197" style="s2">don&#39;t you understand?</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.597" end="00:10:00.697" style="s2">DID SHE JUST SMACK THAT TIGER upside the</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.197" end="00:10:02.997" style="s2">head?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.697" end="00:10:05.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, I won&#39;t eat it. Why&#39;d you have to</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.997" end="00:10:05.497" style="s2">hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.097" end="00:10:09.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t afford a vet bill right now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.097" end="00:10:10.898" style="s2">You eat random junks again and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.698" end="00:10:13.098" style="s2">fasting tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.898" end="00:10:15.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then bring me a few more.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.098" end="00:10:17.098" style="s2">That barely put a dent in my stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.598" end="00:10:17.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here. I&#39;ll see how many we have</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:20.398" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.998" end="00:10:22.498" style="s2">Guys, the tiger is real and that girl is</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.398" end="00:10:24.598" style="s2">a real beast, too. 10 bucks to watch a</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.498" end="00:10:27.498" style="s2">pretty girl smack a Siberian tiger? Best</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.598" end="00:10:27.498" style="s2">money I&#39;ve ever spent.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.798" end="00:10:31.698" style="s2">Last one. That&#39;s all you get today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.117" end="00:10:34.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.698" end="00:10:36.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it? My stomach is still half</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.098" end="00:10:36.598" style="s2">empty.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.298" end="00:10:40.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve cleaned out the last of my</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:42.198" style="s2">emergency cash.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.598" end="00:10:43.598" style="s2">Once I make some money, I&#39;ll get you</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.198" end="00:10:44.598" style="s2">more food.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.598" end="00:10:44.898" style="s2">I&#39;m going to see how many tickets we</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.598" end="00:10:47.298" style="s2">sold today.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.898" end="00:10:48.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; make money. And when you do, buy me a</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.298" end="00:10:50.798" style="s2">giant lamb leg.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.698" end="00:10:52.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat, eat, eat. That&#39;s all you think</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.798" end="00:10:54.998" style="s2">about. Keep it up and you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.598" end="00:10:57.898" style="s2">turn into a fat tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.998" end="00:10:59.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m built, not fat.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.898" end="00:11:03.498" style="s2">THIS IS THE PLACE. THIS is the zoo with</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.998" end="00:11:05.298" style="s2">the director who dared TO SMACK A TIGER.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.498" end="00:11:07.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EVERYBODY STAY IN LINE.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.298" end="00:11:09.698" style="s2">Adult tickets are $10. Students and kids</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.098" end="00:11:12.298" style="s2">are half price, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.698" end="00:11:13.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One adult tickets and two children&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.298" end="00:11:15.998" style="s2">tickets, please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.998" end="00:11:17.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me 10 student tickets. We&#39;re here</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:20.498" style="s2">to see the legend who defeated a</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.398" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">Siberian tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.498" end="00:11:22.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m rich.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.598" end="00:11:24.298" style="s2">We sold more tickets today than we did</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.898" end="00:11:25.898" style="s2">all last month.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.298" end="00:11:29.198" style="s2">If I can keep this up,</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.898" end="00:11:29.198" style="s2">I might actually save the zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:35.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A couple more strokes on the left.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.398" end="00:11:36.798" style="s2">I&#39;ve been on my feet all day.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:38.798" style="s2">I&#39;m exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.798" end="00:11:39.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Siberian tiger is so well behaved.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.798" end="00:11:41.298" style="s2">He looks just like my ragdoll cat at</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.898" end="00:11:45.298" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.298" end="00:11:45.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Max, give everyone a proper roar.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.998" end="00:11:53.798" style="s2">The tiger is still a cat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.798" end="00:11:55.398" style="s2">Max really is my lucky cat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.798" end="00:11:56.798" style="s2">But one Siberian tiger can&#39;t carry an</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.398" end="00:11:57.898" style="s2">entire zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.798" end="00:11:59.098" style="s2">While we&#39;re still getting attention, I</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.898" end="00:12:01.598" style="s2">need to bring in a few more animals</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.098" end="00:12:01.598" style="s2">fast.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.198" end="00:12:05.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, what&#39;s up?</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.698" end="00:12:06.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle John, have you gotten any new</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.398" end="00:12:07.698" style="s2">animals lately that aren&#39;t too</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.498" end="00:12:09.098" style="s2">expensive?</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.698" end="00:12:09.998" style="s2">I need something big to help draw people</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.098" end="00:12:11.398" style="s2">to the zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.998" end="00:12:12.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re really getting the zoo back on</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.398" end="00:12:15.599" style="s2">its feet?</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.599" end="00:12:16.899" style="s2">All right. First, tell me your budget.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.599" end="00:12:18.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only 100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.899" end="00:12:20.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100 grand won&#39;t get you much in the way</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.899" end="00:12:22.899" style="s2">of a large wild animal.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.899" end="00:12:25.699" style="s2">The permits and transportation alone can</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.899" end="00:12:25.699" style="s2">cost a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.899" end="00:12:30.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle John, please</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.999" end="00:12:31.999" style="s2">help me figure something out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.299" end="00:12:33.299" style="s2">I just spent 50 grand on a Siberian</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.999" end="00:12:34.699" style="s2">tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.299" end="00:12:35.999" style="s2">If I pay much more this time, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.699" end="00:12:38.999" style="s2">bankrupt by next month.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.999" end="00:12:40.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 grand for a Siberian tiger?</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.999" end="00:12:41.899" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you bought Mike&#39;s crazy</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.899" end="00:12:43.299" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.899" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the one.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.299" end="00:12:47.299" style="s2">Except he&#39;s not crazy anymore, and now</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.399" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">he&#39;s the star of my zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.299" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I heard.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:51.599" style="s2">I also heard you smacked him on the</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:53.399" style="s2">head.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.599" end="00:12:56.599" style="s2">Nobody could handle that tiger, and</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.399" end="00:12:56.599" style="s2">somehow you took him home.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.199" end="00:13:00.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So can you help me or not?</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.999" end="00:13:01.499" style="s2">As long as it&#39;s big enough to draw a</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.099" end="00:13:02.399" style="s2">crowd, I don&#39;t care if it has a bad</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.499" end="00:13:03.999" style="s2">temper.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.399" end="00:13:05.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you asked anyone else, you&#39;d be out</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.999" end="00:13:05.899" style="s2">of luck.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.353" end="00:13:06.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:09.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew Uncle John would have a</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.899" end="00:13:10.999" style="s2">connection. What animal is it?</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.399" end="00:13:13.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a catch, though.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.999" end="00:13:14.799" style="s2">This animal has serious issues.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.869" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.799" end="00:13:20.299" style="s2">An ordinary keeper can&#39;t handle him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.499" end="00:13:22.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought home a crazy tiger.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.299" end="00:13:23.599" style="s2">What could possibly scare me now?</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.499" end="00:13:25.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.599" end="00:13:27.499" style="s2">If you could straighten out that tiger,</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.499" end="00:13:30.299" style="s2">I actually do have an animal that might</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.499" end="00:13:32.399" style="s2">be perfect for you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.299" end="00:13:34.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it? Just tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.399" end="00:13:36.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A while back, I imported a rare golden</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.699" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">kangaroo from Australia. I was going to</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.899" end="00:13:41.899" style="s2">make him the star attraction here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:43.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A kangaroo?</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.899" end="00:13:44.899" style="s2">Those aren&#39;t cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.199" end="00:13:46.399" style="s2">100 grand probably wouldn&#39;t even buy one</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.899" end="00:13:47.699" style="s2">hair off his tail.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.399" end="00:13:49.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.699" end="00:13:51.399" style="s2">The kangaroo alone cost over a million</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.699" end="00:13:52.699" style="s2">dollars to bring in, and that doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.399" end="00:13:54.599" style="s2">include all the permits and other</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.699" end="00:13:56.199" style="s2">expenses.</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.599" end="00:13:59.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An animal worth a million, and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.199" end="00:14:00.299" style="s2">selling him to me for 100,000?</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.099" end="00:14:01.499" style="s2">You&#39;re an old friend of my dad&#39;s, Uncle</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.299" end="00:14:02.899" style="s2">John. Don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re setting me</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.499" end="00:14:04.399" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.899" end="00:14:06.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I wanted to set you up, I wouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.399" end="00:14:07.499" style="s2">warning you first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.099" end="00:14:09.599" style="s2">They think this guy has serious</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.499" end="00:14:11.299" style="s2">emotional problems, and he loves to</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.599" end="00:14:13.499" style="s2">fight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.299" end="00:14:15.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fighting other males over territory?</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.499" end="00:14:16.601" style="s2">That&#39;s not that unusual for a grown male</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.101" end="00:14:18.801" style="s2">kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.601" end="00:14:21.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish it were just other kangaroos. He</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.801" end="00:14:24.301" style="s2">wants to fight everything he sees.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">Geese, wolves, leopards, he&#39;s gone after</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.301" end="00:14:28.501" style="s2">all of them. A few days ago he chased a</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.501" end="00:14:30.901" style="s2">tiger halfway across the habitat and the</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.501" end="00:14:33.101" style="s2">keepers couldn&#39;t stop him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.901" end="00:14:35.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t bring home a kangaroo. You</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.101" end="00:14:37.901" style="s2">brought home a brawler who walks around</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.101" end="00:14:40.101" style="s2">challenging everybody in sight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.901" end="00:14:41.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The animals are the easy part.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.101" end="00:14:43.301" style="s2">The real problem is he attacks people</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.801" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.301" end="00:14:46.801" style="s2">Several keepers have already ended up in</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:49.701" style="s2">the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.801" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Animals don&#39;t attack for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.701" end="00:14:52.301" style="s2">Does he do anything unusual right before</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.201" end="00:14:53.601" style="s2">he starts a fight?</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.301" end="00:14:55.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I even brought in animal behavior</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.601" end="00:14:56.801" style="s2">specialists, but nobody can figure out</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.101" end="00:14:58.501" style="s2">why he keeps going off.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.801" end="00:15:00.701" style="s2">Physically nothing looks wrong. His</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.501" end="00:15:02.001" style="s2">enclosure meets every standard.</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.701" end="00:15:03.601" style="s2">But he&#39;s getting harder to manage by the</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.001" end="00:15:05.501" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.601" end="00:15:07.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If there&#39;s nothing physically wrong and</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.501" end="00:15:08.101" style="s2">nobody knows why he&#39;s fighting, then</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.101" end="00:15:10.001" style="s2">maybe</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.101" end="00:15:11.901" style="s2">the real problem isn&#39;t his body.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.001" end="00:15:13.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly why I thought of you. If</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.901" end="00:15:15.901" style="s2">you can handle Max, you can take this</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.801" end="00:15:17.601" style="s2">kangaroo for 100 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.901" end="00:15:20.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make one thing clear now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.601" end="00:15:22.101" style="s2">100,000 means 100,000. No raising the</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.501" end="00:15:24.501" style="s2">price when I get there.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.101" end="00:15:26.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy there, kid. Don&#39;t start celebrating</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.501" end="00:15:27.201" style="s2">yet. I haven&#39;t told you all of his</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.101" end="00:15:28.501" style="s2">problems.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.201" end="00:15:30.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s more?</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.501" end="00:15:31.801" style="s2">What, besides beating people up, does he</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.201" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">also trash the place?</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.801" end="00:15:36.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His strangest problem isn&#39;t the</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:38.801" style="s2">fighting. It&#39;s that every time he wins</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.201" end="00:15:39.801" style="s2">he gets depressed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.801" end="00:15:42.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.801" end="00:15:43.101" style="s2">I can understand sulking after a loss.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.101" end="00:15:43.901" style="s2">Why would he get depressed after</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.101" end="00:15:45.201" style="s2">winning?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.901" end="00:15:46.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I knew that I wouldn&#39;t be selling</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.201" end="00:15:48.101" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.601" end="00:15:50.401" style="s2">Every time a fight ends he goes and</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.101" end="00:15:52.301" style="s2">stands facing a wall. A few hours is the</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.401" end="00:15:53.501" style="s2">mild version. Sometimes he won&#39;t eat for</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.301" end="00:15:55.201" style="s2">two or three days.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.501" end="00:15:56.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he attack anyone while he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.201" end="00:15:58.501" style="s2">standing there like that?</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.901" end="00:16:00.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And no keeper can coax him out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.501" end="00:16:02.801" style="s2">No. It&#39;s like he suddenly loses interest</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.801" end="00:16:04.101" style="s2">in everything. He ignores anyone who</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.801" end="00:16:05.301" style="s2">comes near him.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.101" end="00:16:07.401" style="s2">Sometimes</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.301" end="00:16:09.601" style="s2">he even lets out these long, miserable</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.401" end="00:16:11.601" style="s2">sighs.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.601" end="00:16:13.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For somebody with that temper</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.601" end="00:16:15.301" style="s2">he&#39;s surprisingly sensitive.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.201" end="00:16:17.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jokes aside, an animal refusing food for</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.301" end="00:16:19.302" style="s2">that long is dangerous. We&#39;ve tried</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.001" end="00:16:21.302" style="s2">everything and nothing has helped.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.302" end="00:16:22.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I really want to know</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.302" end="00:16:23.902" style="s2">what goes on inside that crazy guy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.902" end="00:16:25.802" style="s2">head all day.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.902" end="00:16:28.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Come by first thing tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.802" end="00:16:30.002" style="s2">morning. I&#39;ll be waiting at the zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.502" end="00:16:32.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The zoo desperately needs another star</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.002" end="00:16:34.702" style="s2">attraction. This opportunity is worth</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.402" end="00:16:36.702" style="s2">the gamble. 100 grand for an animal like</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.702" end="00:16:39.902" style="s2">that? I just hope this troublemaker</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.702" end="00:16:39.902" style="s2">doesn&#39;t make the trip a waste.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.502" end="00:16:46.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.002" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">If you&#39;d gotten here much later,</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.702" end="00:16:49.102" style="s2">I honestly don&#39;t know how long you&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:51.302" style="s2">have held out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.102" end="00:16:52.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday he was just depressed.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.302" end="00:16:53.802" style="s2">What happened next?</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.702" end="00:16:55.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday he somehow got into the</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.802" end="00:16:57.802" style="s2">neighboring habitat and picked a fight</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.502" end="00:16:59.802" style="s2">with a full-grown leopard.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.802" end="00:17:00.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A kangaroo took on a leopard?</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.802" end="00:17:02.002" style="s2">Who won?</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.602" end="00:17:03.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The leopard ended up hiding on top of</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.002" end="00:17:05.702" style="s2">the rocks cuz it was too scared to come</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:07.702" style="s2">down. Only then did this lunatic stop.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.702" end="00:17:10.502" style="s2">But ever since the fight,</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:10.502" style="s2">he&#39;s been like this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.602" end="00:17:18.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s been standing there all night?</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.002" end="00:17:19.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ever since they brought him back</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.102" end="00:17:21.502" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.702" end="00:17:23.702" style="s2">More than 10 hours and he hasn&#39;t moved</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.502" end="00:17:25.602" style="s2">an inch.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.702" end="00:17:27.502" style="s2">We brought him food three times today.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.602" end="00:17:29.302" style="s2">He hasn&#39;t touched a bite.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.502" end="00:17:32.202" style="s2">The vet came in overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.302" end="00:17:34.402" style="s2">Blood work, full exam, everything.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.202" end="00:17:36.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still no clear cause.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.402" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; John, looks like your million dollar</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.102" end="00:17:39.602" style="s2">golden boy is finally done for.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.002" end="00:17:41.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason Blake.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.602" end="00:17:43.002" style="s2">What the hell are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.402" end="00:17:44.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard your rare golden kangaroo was</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.002" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">dying, so I was kind enough to bring an</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.602" end="00:17:48.402" style="s2">expert over.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.502" end="00:17:50.202" style="s2">That&#39;s a magnificent specimen. He&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.402" end="00:17:51.402" style="s2">top tier even in Australia. What a</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.202" end="00:17:53.302" style="s2">shame.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.402" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">He&#39;s just waiting to die here anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.302" end="00:17:55.902" style="s2">Sell him to me for 30 grand. I&#39;ll take</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:17:57.802" style="s2">him back, see what I can do, and maybe</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.902" end="00:17:59.802" style="s2">save his life.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.802" end="00:18:01.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30,000?</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:03.202" style="s2">Jason Blake, do you think I&#39;m an idiot?</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.902" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">Or did you come here just to kick me</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.202" end="00:18:07.402" style="s2">while I&#39;m down?</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.402" end="00:18:08.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too low?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.402" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">Take another look at him and ask</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.402" end="00:18:11.002" style="s2">yourself how much a dead kangaroo is</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.802" end="00:18:13.502" style="s2">worth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.002" end="00:18:15.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a purebred rare golden kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.502" end="00:18:16.502" style="s2">Even in Australia, one like him costs</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.002" end="00:18:18.002" style="s2">hundreds of thousands of dollars. Add</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.502" end="00:18:19.402" style="s2">shipping permits and the habitat I built</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.002" end="00:18:20.403" style="s2">for him and I put over a million into</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.402" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">this animal and you want to walk out</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.403" end="00:18:21.803" style="s2">with him for 30 grand? That&#39;s highway</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.503" end="00:18:23.903" style="s2">robber.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.803" end="00:18:25.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million, 10 million,</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.903" end="00:18:27.103" style="s2">doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.403" end="00:18:29.003" style="s2">An animal is an asset only while it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.103" end="00:18:30.403" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.003" end="00:18:31.303" style="s2">Once it&#39;s dead, it&#39;s just a pile of</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.403" end="00:18:32.503" style="s2">meat.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.303" end="00:18:34.103" style="s2">Look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.503" end="00:18:36.303" style="s2">He won&#39;t even eat.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.103" end="00:18:39.203" style="s2">Wait a few more days,</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.303" end="00:18:40.303" style="s2">and you won&#39;t get 30 grand from anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.203" end="00:18:42.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:44.103" style="s2">smug commentary.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.803" end="00:18:45.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m helping you</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.103" end="00:18:47.303" style="s2">cut your losses.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.603" end="00:18:49.003" style="s2">30 grand plus I take on the treatment</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.303" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">and transportation costs, that&#39;s more</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.003" end="00:18:51.403" style="s2">than fair.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.703" end="00:18:56.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to think about it. You&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.403" end="00:18:58.103" style="s2">taking this kangaroo anywhere today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.703" end="00:18:59.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.103" end="00:19:00.703" style="s2">Two zoo owners are discussing business.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.503" end="00:19:02.103" style="s2">What makes you think you get a say?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.703" end="00:19:03.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Uncle John already agreed to</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.103" end="00:19:06.403" style="s2">sell him to me yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.703" end="00:19:07.703" style="s2">$100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.403" end="00:19:09.603" style="s2">I was here first.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.703" end="00:19:11.203" style="s2">Understand?</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.603" end="00:19:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, look who it is.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.203" end="00:19:14.703" style="s2">The director of that little Carter</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.303" end="00:19:16.103" style="s2">family zoo that&#39;s about to go under.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.703" end="00:19:18.703" style="s2">You&#39;re still open?</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.103" end="00:19:20.703" style="s2">I figured you&#39;d have shut down by now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.703" end="00:19:22.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your place hasn&#39;t gone under yet, so</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.703" end="00:19:23.503" style="s2">naturally mine has to stay open a little</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.103" end="00:19:25.003" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.503" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">Somebody needs to be around to watch you</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.003" end="00:19:30.103" style="s2">embarrass yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.903" end="00:19:31.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the girl from that video online.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.103" end="00:19:33.003" style="s2">The one smacking a Siberian tiger on the</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.703" end="00:19:34.103" style="s2">head, right?</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.003" end="00:19:35.403" style="s2">You pull a little stunt to bring in</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.103" end="00:19:37.103" style="s2">tours and suddenly you think you&#39;re some</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:38.603" style="s2">master animal trainer?</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.103" end="00:19:40.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you finished?</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.603" end="00:19:41.603" style="s2">If you are, move.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.303" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">I came to see the kangaroo, not listen</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.603" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">to you run your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.908" end="00:19:47.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.403" end="00:19:49.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fixing one crazy tiger was luck.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.903" end="00:19:51.303" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you think you can fix this</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.103" end="00:19:52.703" style="s2">kangaroo, too. Running a zoo isn&#39;t some</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.303" end="00:19:53.803" style="s2">kid&#39;s game.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.703" end="00:19:55.903" style="s2">That dump of yours can&#39;t even put</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.803" end="00:19:57.203" style="s2">together a decent veterinary team.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.903" end="00:19:59.403" style="s2">How exactly do you plan to compete with</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.203" end="00:19:59.403" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.003" end="00:20:03.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few people in white coats standing</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.303" end="00:20:04.603" style="s2">behind you makes you professional?</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.503" end="00:20:07.603" style="s2">If that&#39;s all you&#39;ve got to say, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.603" end="00:20:07.603" style="s2">really not interested.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.603" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Michael Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:13.403" style="s2">why don&#39;t you explain to this little</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:15.103" style="s2">girl</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.403" end="00:20:16.303" style="s2">what real veterinary medicine looks</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.103" end="00:20:18.503" style="s2">like?</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.303" end="00:20:20.503" style="s2">Based on the symptoms we&#39;ve observed,</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.503" end="00:20:22.903" style="s2">I believe he is displaying severe manic</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.503" end="00:20:24.005" style="s2">behavior accompanied by clear depressive</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.903" end="00:20:26.105" style="s2">symptoms.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.005" end="00:20:27.505" style="s2">He originally lived in Australia.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.105" end="00:20:28.905" style="s2">After a long distance move into a</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.505" end="00:20:31.205" style="s2">completely different environment and</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.905" end="00:20:34.105" style="s2">climate, a major stress response would</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.205" end="00:20:34.105" style="s2">be very plausible.</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.605" end="00:20:37.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.205" end="00:20:38.905" style="s2">he keeps picking fights with other</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.605" end="00:20:40.605" style="s2">animals.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.905" end="00:20:42.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.605" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">Unprovoked aggression and an inability</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.605" end="00:20:46.905" style="s2">to socialize normally are both</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.705" end="00:20:48.705" style="s2">consistent with manic behavior.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.905" end="00:20:52.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why does he shut down every time he</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.705" end="00:20:53.905" style="s2">wins? Why won&#39;t he even eat?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.005" end="00:20:55.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because his neurological regulation is</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.905" end="00:20:56.805" style="s2">unstable.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.505" end="00:20:58.505" style="s2">Once the heightened state ends, he</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.805" end="00:21:00.889" style="s2">crashes rapidly into the opposite</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.505" end="00:21:02.105" style="s2">extreme, lethargy and depression.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.889" end="00:21:04.605" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.105" end="00:21:06.105" style="s2">You hear that? That&#39;s science.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.605" end="00:21:07.505" style="s2">You don&#39;t fix this by petting him a few</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.105" end="00:21:10.205" style="s2">times</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.505" end="00:21:10.205" style="s2">and talking to him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.505" end="00:21:15.105" style="s2">Look at his coat.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.905" end="00:21:16.605" style="s2">It&#39;s clearly lost its shine.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.105" end="00:21:19.105" style="s2">His eyes are also much more sunken than</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.605" end="00:21:20.705" style="s2">they should be.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.105" end="00:21:22.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.705" end="00:21:24.405" style="s2">Can he still be saved?</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.905" end="00:21:26.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He needs immediate isolation and</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.405" end="00:21:29.205" style="s2">treatment by a professional team</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.505" end="00:21:30.605" style="s2">with strict control of outside stimulus.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.205" end="00:21:32.805" style="s2">One wrong move could push him into a</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.605" end="00:21:34.705" style="s2">complete breakdown.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.805" end="00:21:36.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It sounds convincing,</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.705" end="00:21:38.905" style="s2">but the longer I look at him,</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.905" end="00:21:41.305" style="s2">the less he looks sick to me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.905" end="00:21:44.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The expert has made it perfectly clear.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.305" end="00:21:45.905" style="s2">This isn&#39;t the time to pinch pennies.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.105" end="00:21:48.005" style="s2">Keep dragging this out, and he could die</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.905" end="00:21:49.305" style="s2">right here within hours.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.005" end="00:21:50.905" style="s2">And if you let Emma take him back to</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.305" end="00:21:52.505" style="s2">that broken-down zoo of hers without</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.905" end="00:21:53.305" style="s2">even proper equipment,</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.505" end="00:21:53.705" style="s2">he probably won&#39;t make it through</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.305" end="00:21:55.605" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.705" end="00:21:56.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, talk about the animal if you</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.605" end="00:21:58.805" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.905" end="00:22:00.605" style="s2">Stop calling my zoo broken down. My</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.805" end="00:22:02.505" style="s2">business is none of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.605" end="00:22:03.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just stating facts.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.505" end="00:22:06.705" style="s2">If you really have a professional team,</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.705" end="00:22:06.705" style="s2">bring them out and let me see them.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.605" end="00:22:10.105" style="s2">Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.905" end="00:22:12.205" style="s2">maybe we should let Jason take the</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.105" end="00:22:13.905" style="s2">kangaroo for now. I&#39;m not going back on</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.205" end="00:22:15.805" style="s2">my word.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.905" end="00:22:17.405" style="s2">But 100,000 is a lot of money for your</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.805" end="00:22:18.705" style="s2">zoo right now.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.405" end="00:22:19.605" style="s2">I can&#39;t stand here and watch you throw</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.705" end="00:22:21.605" style="s2">it away.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.605" end="00:22:22.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;re trying to protect me</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.605" end="00:22:24.105" style="s2">first,</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.805" end="00:22:26.506" style="s2">but business is first come, first</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.105" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">served. I was here first. So until I</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:30.306" style="s2">clearly say I don&#39;t want him,</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.506" end="00:22:32.306" style="s2">nobody gets to swoop in and take him.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.306" end="00:22:34.606" style="s2">The zoo is finally starting to recover.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.306" end="00:22:36.706" style="s2">Max&#39;s popularity won&#39;t last forever, so</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.606" end="00:22:38.206" style="s2">I need another star animal fast. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.706" end="00:22:42.006" style="s2">probably never get another chance to buy</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.206" end="00:22:45.106" style="s2">an animal of this level for 100 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.006" end="00:22:45.106" style="s2">I have to take the gamble.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.106" end="00:22:49.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma Carter,</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.606" end="00:22:52.106" style="s2">do you even know the first thing about</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.906" end="00:22:54.606" style="s2">animal psychology? This isn&#39;t the time</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.106" end="00:22:56.306" style="s2">to show off.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.606" end="00:22:57.706" style="s2">Mania and depression, do you know how to</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.306" end="00:22:58.806" style="s2">treat either one?</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.706" end="00:23:00.506" style="s2">You don&#39;t know anything, yet you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.806" end="00:23:02.906" style="s2">still arguing with me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.506" end="00:23:06.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put your hand down.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.906" end="00:23:06.106" style="s2">I don&#39;t like people pointing at me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.606" end="00:23:09.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.706" end="00:23:10.606" style="s2">Did I hit a nerve?</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.206" end="00:23:12.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I may not understand all those animal</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.606" end="00:23:14.106" style="s2">psychology theories you keep throwing</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.006" end="00:23:15.606" style="s2">around, but as far as I&#39;m concerned, at</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.106" end="00:23:16.506" style="s2">least half of what your expert just said</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.606" end="00:23:18.206" style="s2">is</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.506" end="00:23:20.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may question me, but you do not get</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.206" end="00:23:21.706" style="s2">to insult modern veterinary medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.006" end="00:23:23.706" style="s2">This animal is already in an extremely</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.706" end="00:23:25.406" style="s2">dangerous state. Any intense stimulation</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.706" end="00:23:26.806" style="s2">could worsen his mental condition. If</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.406" end="00:23:29.706" style="s2">handled inappropriately, the stress and</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.806" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">physical weakness could kill him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.706" end="00:23:33.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything I do causes his death, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:35.606" style="s2">take full responsibility. I&#39;ll pay the</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.906" end="00:23:36.106" style="s2">money and none of the consequences will</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.606" end="00:23:37.006" style="s2">be yours.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.106" end="00:23:39.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.006" end="00:23:41.006" style="s2">this isn&#39;t something to do out of spite.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.106" end="00:23:42.306" style="s2">Have you really thought this through?</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.006" end="00:23:43.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.306" end="00:23:46.906" style="s2">At the very least, I need to understand</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.606" end="00:23:46.906" style="s2">what&#39;s actually going on first.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.506" end="00:23:53.306" style="s2">Hey, I hear you spend every day beating</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.706" end="00:23:54.806" style="s2">up other animals then get depressed and</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.306" end="00:23:56.806" style="s2">they&#39;re pretending to be deep.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.806" end="00:23:57.906" style="s2">If something&#39;s wrong, say it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.806" end="00:23:59.206" style="s2">Starving yourself doesn&#39;t prove</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.906" end="00:24:01.006" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.206" end="00:24:03.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma Carter, maybe the kangaroo isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.006" end="00:24:03.906" style="s2">the sick one, you are.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.106" end="00:24:05.306" style="s2">You&#39;re actually trying to have a</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.906" end="00:24:06.406" style="s2">conversation with a kangaroo. What, you</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.306" end="00:24:08.206" style="s2">think he&#39;s going to open his mouth and</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.406" end="00:24:09.606" style="s2">answer you? This is completely</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.206" end="00:24:11.206" style="s2">pointless.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.606" end="00:24:13.806" style="s2">Animals have limited intelligence and</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.206" end="00:24:15.106" style="s2">cannot understand language this complex.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.806" end="00:24:18.206" style="s2">Shouting at him like this will only</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:19.706" style="s2">aggravate his condition.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.206" end="00:24:23.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.706" end="00:24:24.806" style="s2">You really can understand me, human.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.006" end="00:24:25.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You can talk.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.806" end="00:24:27.306" style="s2">Now I don&#39;t have to listen to those</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.906" end="00:24:28.206" style="s2">people out there and make wild guesses</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.306" end="00:24:28.607" style="s2">all day.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.206" end="00:24:30.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been here</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.607" end="00:24:32.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; a long time and you&#39;re the first human</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.507" end="00:24:33.707" style="s2">I&#39;ve ever met who can actually talk to</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.107" end="00:24:35.007" style="s2">animals.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.707" end="00:24:37.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you&#39;ve got severe mania and</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.007" end="00:24:38.307" style="s2">depression, refuse to eat or drink and</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.207" end="00:24:39.807" style="s2">you&#39;re trying to starve yourself to</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.307" end="00:24:43.507" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.807" end="00:24:45.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the hell did you just say? that again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.507" end="00:24:46.807" style="s2">Oh no, he&#39;s having another episode.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.007" end="00:24:49.908" style="s2">Emma, stop provoking him. Get back here</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.807" end="00:24:49.908" style="s2">before he comes after you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.307" end="00:24:56.507" style="s2">I warned you not to stimulate him. Look.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.908" end="00:24:58.408" style="s2">His manic symptoms are flaring up again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.507" end="00:25:01.107" style="s2">Severe mania followed by depression will</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.408" end="00:25:03.307" style="s2">drain his body fast.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.107" end="00:25:06.507" style="s2">If he dies because of this, your</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.307" end="00:25:07.908" style="s2">ignorance will have killed him.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.507" end="00:25:09.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the crazy one. I&#39;m perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.908" end="00:25:11.007" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.408" end="00:25:13.507" style="s2">What idiot said I have mania and</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.007" end="00:25:15.207" style="s2">depression?</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.507" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why do you pick fights every day</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.207" end="00:25:19.408" style="s2">and refuse to eat afterward? If that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.307" end="00:25:21.307" style="s2">not a problem, what is?</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.408" end="00:25:23.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those aren&#39;t fights. I&#39;m challenging</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.307" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">worthy opponents. I defeat everyone I</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.408" end="00:25:27.307" style="s2">face. Do you have any idea how lonely it</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.607" end="00:25:30.007" style="s2">is at the top? And I stopped eating</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.307" end="00:25:32.007" style="s2">because these stupid humans piss me off.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.007" end="00:25:33.707" style="s2">I fought a few matches. So what? They</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.007" end="00:25:35.908" style="s2">lock me up alone and make me stare at</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.707" end="00:25:37.908" style="s2">this stupid wall all day. There&#39;s nobody</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.908" end="00:25:40.908" style="s2">here worth sparring with. I&#39;m a leader</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.908" end="00:25:42.307" style="s2">among kangaroos, a born fighter.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.908" end="00:25:43.908" style="s2">What&#39;s the point of living if you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.307" end="00:25:46.207" style="s2">have an opponent?</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.908" end="00:25:47.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it. He&#39;s not sick at all. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.207" end="00:25:48.607" style="s2">just</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.107" end="00:25:49.707" style="s2">kind of nuts in a completely different</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.607" end="00:25:51.307" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.707" end="00:25:53.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know Bruce Lee?</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.307" end="00:25:56.307" style="s2">Now that was a true master.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.107" end="00:25:58.607" style="s2">The greatest fighter I&#39;ve ever admired.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.307" end="00:25:59.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a kangaroo from Australia and you</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.607" end="00:26:02.507" style="s2">know Bruce Lee?</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.807" end="00:26:04.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Your punches have to be fast,</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.507" end="00:26:05.707" style="s2">your moves have to hit hard, and you</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.007" end="00:26:07.908" style="s2">have to look good doing it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.707" end="00:26:09.908" style="s2">That&#39;s a real martial artist.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.908" end="00:26:11.507" style="s2">I saw his movies when I was young and</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.908" end="00:26:13.807" style="s2">ever since then I&#39;ve sworn I&#39;d become a</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.507" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">true hero one day.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.807" end="00:26:16.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So he&#39;s not manic.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.307" end="00:26:19.207" style="s2">He&#39;s watched so many martial arts movies</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.908" end="00:26:21.408" style="s2">he&#39;s brainwashed himself.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.207" end="00:26:23.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The higher a master climbs, the lonelier</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.408" end="00:26:25.007" style="s2">it gets.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.607" end="00:26:26.007" style="s2">I haven&#39;t met a real opponent in a long</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.007" end="00:26:27.408" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.007" end="00:26:28.908" style="s2">If I can&#39;t find a worthy fighter and I</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.408" end="00:26:30.107" style="s2">can&#39;t become a hero,</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.908" end="00:26:31.709" style="s2">what&#39;s the difference between living and</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.107" end="00:26:33.309" style="s2">being a puddle of dead water?</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.709" end="00:26:35.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder he stands there sighing at the</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.309" end="00:26:37.209" style="s2">wall every day. He&#39;s not depressed. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.809" end="00:26:38.409" style="s2">imagining himself as some kind of</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.209" end="00:26:40.109" style="s2">superhero.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.409" end="00:26:41.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got guts, human. Everybody else</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.109" end="00:26:43.809" style="s2">runs when they sees me, but you actually</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.509" end="00:26:45.409" style="s2">dare to talk trash to my face.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.809" end="00:26:46.809" style="s2">My fists are itching anyway. How about</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.409" end="00:26:48.509" style="s2">you spar with me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.809" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fight you?</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.509" end="00:26:51.009" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.109" end="00:26:54.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Scared?</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.909" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">Relax. I&#39;ll give you the first three</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:56.909" style="s2">moves.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.409" end="00:27:02.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll fight you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.709" end="00:27:03.909" style="s2">But we set the terms first.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.909" end="00:27:06.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What terms?</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.909" end="00:27:08.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I win, you listen to me from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.909" end="00:27:10.313" style="s2">No more picking random fights with</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.409" end="00:27:10.509" style="s2">animals or keepers.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.313" end="00:27:12.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.509" end="00:27:14.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that little body? Fine. If you can</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.509" end="00:27:14.709" style="s2">beat me, I won&#39;t just listen. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.009" end="00:27:16.209" style="s2">you boss.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.709" end="00:27:17.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what his problem is now. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.209" end="00:27:18.609" style="s2">take the kangaroo for 100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.509" end="00:27:20.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you doing now? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.609" end="00:27:22.309" style="s2">practically dying and you still want to</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.009" end="00:27:22.309" style="s2">buy him?</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.809" end="00:27:26.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you he&#39;s about to die?</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.909" end="00:27:28.009" style="s2">He looks more alive than you do right</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.109" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.009" end="00:27:30.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.109" end="00:27:32.009" style="s2">You&#39;re going to use a dying animal as</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.309" end="00:27:33.409" style="s2">one last publicity stunt for that dump</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.009" end="00:27:35.709" style="s2">of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.409" end="00:27:37.209" style="s2">If he dies, maybe you&#39;ll trend again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.709" end="00:27:38.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t project your dirty little schemes</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.209" end="00:27:40.409" style="s2">onto me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:42.209" style="s2">If I&#39;m buying him, it&#39;s because I know</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.409" end="00:27:43.309" style="s2">how to solve the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.209" end="00:27:44.209" style="s2">Could you get me two strips of sturdy</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.309" end="00:27:45.709" style="s2">cloth?</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.209" end="00:27:46.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cloth?</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.709" end="00:27:48.209" style="s2">What do you need cloth for?</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.709" end="00:27:49.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am treating him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.209" end="00:27:52.209" style="s2">My method is just a little different</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.409" end="00:27:52.209" style="s2">from the experts.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.109" end="00:27:56.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.309" end="00:27:58.309" style="s2">What are you planning to do?</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.509" end="00:27:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go in there and have a proper talk with</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.309" end="00:28:00.109" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.709" end="00:28:02.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.109" end="00:28:03.309" style="s2">Going in there is suicide. A full-grown</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.009" end="00:28:04.609" style="s2">kangaroo&#39;s punch and kicks are extremely</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.309" end="00:28:06.209" style="s2">dangerous. He can seriously injure an</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.609" end="00:28:07.909" style="s2">adult. And now you&#39;re actually preparing</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.209" end="00:28:09.409" style="s2">to use violence against him? I will not</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:10.409" style="s2">allow animal abuse.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.409" end="00:28:12.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t even know what he really</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.409" end="00:28:14.809" style="s2">wants, and you&#39;re still standing here</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.609" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">lecturing me with theories. Sometimes an</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.809" end="00:28:18.409" style="s2">idiot is more dangerous than a bad</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.609" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">person. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.409" end="00:28:21.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.309" end="00:28:22.809" style="s2">kill him. If anything happens, I will</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.009" end="00:28:25.709" style="s2">hold you responsible.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.809" end="00:28:25.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You &#39;ve got guts.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.409" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">You &#39;ve got guts.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.409" end="00:28:30.509" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.309" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">You look like a stiff breeze could knock</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.509" end="00:28:33.710" style="s2">you over, so I&#39;ll give you the first</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:34.910" style="s2">three moves. Don&#39;t want saying I bullied</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.710" end="00:28:35.910" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.910" end="00:28:38.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.910" end="00:28:41.010" style="s2">Your idea, your rules.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.110" end="00:28:41.010" style="s2">Don&#39;t regret it in a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.910" end="00:28:45.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fast. You human actually know how to</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.410" end="00:28:46.710" style="s2">fight.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.210" end="00:28:48.210" style="s2">Emma, watch his legs. One of the keepers</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.710" end="00:28:48.710" style="s2">ended up in the hospital after a single</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.210" end="00:28:50.510" style="s2">kick.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.710" end="00:28:53.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She walked in there looking for trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.510" end="00:28:53.710" style="s2">Whatever happens is on her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.810" end="00:28:56.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not bad. I&#39;ve been trapped here forever</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.710" end="00:28:58.610" style="s2">and I finally found somebody with a</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.710" end="00:29:00.910" style="s2">little skill. Again, this time I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.610" end="00:29:02.810" style="s2">holding back.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.910" end="00:29:05.310" style="s2">Wait, wait. Why do you hit so damn hard?</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.810" end="00:29:07.310" style="s2">STOP. STOP THIS RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.310" end="00:29:08.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU WERE PRETTY cocky a second ago.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.310" end="00:29:10.610" style="s2">So, you give up?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.810" end="00:29:11.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I give up. I give up. Fine, you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.610" end="00:29:12.810" style="s2">boss. Happy now? You&#39;re a freaking</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.910" end="00:29:13.810" style="s2">demon.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.810" end="00:29:15.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to keep picking fights with</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.810" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">other animals? What about the keepers?</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.810" end="00:29:19.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I swear I&#39;ll stop starting fights.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.610" end="00:29:21.910" style="s2">And if anyone else causes trouble, I can</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.210" end="00:29:21.910" style="s2">beat them up for you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.210" end="00:29:27.710" style="s2">She looks so skinny.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.610" end="00:29:30.710" style="s2">How do her hits hurt that much?</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.710" end="00:29:32.410" style="s2">I finally [snorts] met a real master.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.710" end="00:29:34.010" style="s2">She actually beat a full-grown kangaroo</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.410" end="00:29:36.910" style="s2">into submission</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.010" end="00:29:36.910" style="s2">with her bare hands.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:43.310" style="s2">She looks so skinny.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.210" end="00:29:45.710" style="s2">How do her hits hurt that much?</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.310" end="00:29:46.910" style="s2">I finally met a real master.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.710" end="00:29:48.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See,</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.910" end="00:29:50.310" style="s2">some troublemakers can hear 100 theories</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.710" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">and learn nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.310" end="00:29:55.410" style="s2">One good heating</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.010" end="00:29:55.410" style="s2">and suddenly everything makes sense.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.510" end="00:29:59.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, I&#39;ve been around animals my whole</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.910" end="00:30:01.310" style="s2">life and I&#39;ve never seen anyone treat a</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.510" end="00:30:04.010" style="s2">kangaroo like that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.310" end="00:30:06.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was never sick.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.010" end="00:30:07.510" style="s2">He&#39;s just obsessed with fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.510" end="00:30:08.810" style="s2">The more you stopped him from moving</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.510" end="00:30:09.910" style="s2">around,</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.810" end="00:30:11.610" style="s2">the more he felt like he was wasting</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.910" end="00:30:13.410" style="s2">away in a cage.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.610" end="00:30:16.110" style="s2">Our $100,000 deal still stands. Please</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.410" end="00:30:17.110" style="s2">arrange the transport truck.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.110" end="00:30:18.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.110" end="00:30:20.010" style="s2">You got his spirit back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.810" end="00:30:21.810" style="s2">Now I really do feel safe handing him</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.010" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">over to you. Beating an animal into</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.810" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">submission and calling it treatment,</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.310" end="00:30:26.210" style="s2">that&#39;s absurd.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.710" end="00:30:27.910" style="s2">The excitement is only temporarily</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.210" end="00:30:29.110" style="s2">masking his exhaustion.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.910" end="00:30:31.710" style="s2">This kind of violent handling could</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.110" end="00:30:34.710" style="s2">leave serious aftereffects.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">Once that kangaroo gets to your zoo,</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.710" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">he&#39;ll be dead within three days.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.010" end="00:30:40.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.712" end="00:30:42.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then keep waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.312" end="00:30:45.412" style="s2">he&#39;s still alive three days from now,</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.412" end="00:30:47.112" style="s2">what excuse are you going to use?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.412" end="00:30:48.612" style="s2">Come on, we&#39;re leaving. [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.112" end="00:30:49.612" style="s2">You&#39;ve got a new place to live. What are</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.612" end="00:30:52.412" style="s2">you waiting for? Want to stay here and</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.612" end="00:30:52.412" style="s2">keep staring at the wall?</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.212" end="00:30:57.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wait. Wherever boss goes, I go. I</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.012" end="00:30:58.512" style="s2">promise I&#39;ll behave from now on, but you</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.412" end="00:30:59.912" style="s2">have to spar with me every few days,</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.512" end="00:31:02.612" style="s2">okay? Otherwise I&#39;m seriously going to</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.912" end="00:31:02.612" style="s2">lose my mind.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.512" end="00:31:08.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sparing is fine, but rule number one,</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.912" end="00:31:10.612" style="s2">eat. You&#39;re half starved and still</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.012" end="00:31:12.012" style="s2">trying to act like some great master.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.612" end="00:31:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as I get to fight, I&#39;ll eat</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.012" end="00:31:16.512" style="s2">anything. Hell, I&#39;ll chew through two</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.712" end="00:31:16.512" style="s2">bowls of grass.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.212" end="00:31:22.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s been here all this time,</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:24.412" style="s2">and this is the first time I&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.712" end="00:31:25.712" style="s2">seen him eat on his own and actually</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.412" end="00:31:27.112" style="s2">enjoy it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.712" end="00:31:29.012" style="s2">Now that&#39;s better. You need a full</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.112" end="00:31:31.012" style="s2">stomach if you&#39;re going to train. Boss,</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.012" end="00:31:32.512" style="s2">I could go for a little more.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.012" end="00:31:33.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t you on a hunger strike 5 minutes</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.512" end="00:31:36.012" style="s2">ago?</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.412" end="00:31:36.012" style="s2">Now you&#39;re hungry?</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.312" end="00:31:40.112" style="s2">You try starving yourself again, and</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.112" end="00:31:41.712" style="s2">I&#39;ll deal with you first.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.112" end="00:31:43.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, boss. I&#39;ll eat properly from now</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.712" end="00:31:45.112" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.812" end="00:31:46.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So doctor,</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.112" end="00:31:48.212" style="s2">are you still going to tell me his</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.212" end="00:31:49.612" style="s2">organs will fail within a few hours?</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.212" end="00:31:51.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This only proves that his appetite has</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.612" end="00:31:52.912" style="s2">temporarily returned. It does not prove</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.512" end="00:31:54.712" style="s2">the underlying psychological issue is</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.912" end="00:31:56.112" style="s2">gone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.712" end="00:31:58.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your biggest problem is that you take</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.112" end="00:32:00.212" style="s2">symptoms from a textbook and force them</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.412" end="00:32:02.212" style="s2">onto every animal.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.212" end="00:32:04.312" style="s2">You never stop to consider that animals</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:05.412" style="s2">have personalities and thoughts of their</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.312" end="00:32:06.712" style="s2">own.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.412" end="00:32:09.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just got lucky. Don&#39;t think you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.712" end="00:32:11.212" style="s2">get lucky every time.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.712" end="00:32:12.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let the door hit you. Next time</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.212" end="00:32:15.212" style="s2">you come for the show, remember to buy a</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.812" end="00:32:15.212" style="s2">ticket.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.612" end="00:32:21.312" style="s2">All right, you&#39;ve eaten. Come home with</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:23.912" style="s2">me. From now on, that&#39;s your turf.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.312" end="00:32:25.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, don&#39;t forget your promise. We spar</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.912" end="00:32:26.812" style="s2">every week.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.712" end="00:32:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.812" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">Now get in the truck and don&#39;t start</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">trouble on day one.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.512" end="00:32:37.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, where have you been? I&#39;m starving</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.912" end="00:32:38.712" style="s2">to death over here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.512" end="00:32:40.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit yelling.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.712" end="00:32:42.013" style="s2">I just got back. Is food seriously the</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.213" end="00:32:45.113" style="s2">only thing you think about all day?</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.013" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, who&#39;s that? Whoever it is, they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.113" end="00:32:48.213" style="s2">got a pretty powerful voice.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.913" end="00:32:49.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your future neighbor,</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.213" end="00:32:50.713" style="s2">a white tiger whose appetite is even</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.913" end="00:32:51.913" style="s2">bigger than your temper.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.713" end="00:32:53.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. I&#39;ve been standing around</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.913" end="00:32:54.313" style="s2">for tours all day. I&#39;m wasting my</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.213" end="00:32:55.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me get your new neighbor settled first,</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.313" end="00:32:56.213" style="s2">then I&#39;ll feed you. Keep the roaring</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.513" end="00:32:58.313" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.213" end="00:33:01.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A white tiger? He must be tough. Want me</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.313" end="00:33:03.113" style="s2">to go over and spar with him?</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.013" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you already forget what I said?</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.113" end="00:33:08.113" style="s2">First rule at your new home,</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:09.513" style="s2">no picking random fights.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.113" end="00:33:11.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.513" end="00:33:12.813" style="s2">If boss says no fighting, I won&#39;t fight</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.813" end="00:33:15.013" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.813" end="00:33:16.613" style="s2">Boss, this is your turf. Didn&#39;t you say</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.013" end="00:33:17.813" style="s2">I&#39;d live like a king? Why does this</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.613" end="00:33:19.113" style="s2">place look even rougher than the old</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.813" end="00:33:20.813" style="s2">man&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.113" end="00:33:22.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t judge it yet. We&#39;re just getting</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.813" end="00:33:24.213" style="s2">back on our feet. Once we have money,</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.613" end="00:33:25.413" style="s2">we&#39;ll improve things little by little.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.213" end="00:33:27.013" style="s2">It looks old outside, but I&#39;ve already</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.413" end="00:33:30.213" style="s2">fixed up the inside. There&#39;s plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.013" end="00:33:30.213" style="s2">room to exercise and rest.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.613" end="00:33:36.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a rare golden kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.513" end="00:33:38.313" style="s2">Living somewhere too shabby damages</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.113" end="00:33:39.413" style="s2">[snorts] a master&#39;s image.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.313" end="00:33:40.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny.</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.413" end="00:33:42.313" style="s2">You weren&#39;t worried about your master&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.613" end="00:33:45.013" style="s2">image when I had you pinned to the floor</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.313" end="00:33:46.513" style="s2">calling me boss. Behave yourself and</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.013" end="00:33:48.513" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you two rewards.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.513" end="00:33:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rewards? And just so we&#39;re clear,</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.513" end="00:33:50.313" style="s2">ordinary carrots aren&#39;t enough to buy me</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.013" end="00:33:51.913" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.313" end="00:33:52.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, I&#39;ll spar with you three times a</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.913" end="00:33:54.113" style="s2">week.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.313" end="00:33:55.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three times? You better keep your word.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.113" end="00:33:56.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second, I&#39;ll find you some Bruce Lee</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.613" end="00:33:57.313" style="s2">movies.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.113" end="00:33:58.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bruce Lee, you really are exactly what I</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.313" end="00:34:00.313" style="s2">want. I want to watch movies.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.813" end="00:34:02.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two seconds ago, this place was too</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.313" end="00:34:02.913" style="s2">shabby.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.613" end="00:34:07.313" style="s2">Mention a movie and suddenly he can run</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.213" end="00:34:08.713" style="s2">faster than anybody. I downloaded the</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.313" end="00:34:11.113" style="s2">movies for you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.713" end="00:34:13.513" style="s2">Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.113" end="00:34:16.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really is Bruce Lee. From this day</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.513" end="00:34:18.713" style="s2">on, you are the human I respect most.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.313" end="00:34:20.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One condition. You can watch movies, but</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.713" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">don&#39;t use the tablet for target practice</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.513" end="00:34:23.213" style="s2">and don&#39;t get excited and smash the</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.113" end="00:34:25.513" style="s2">screen.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.213" end="00:34:29.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Anybody who hurts this</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.513" end="00:34:29.113" style="s2">treasure answers to me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:35.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Max thinks about nothing but food. This</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.213" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">one thinks about nothing but fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.113" end="00:34:38.313" style="s2">What kind of monsters am I raising?</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.713" end="00:34:41.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is it, right? I heard the new</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.313" end="00:34:43.014" style="s2">kangaroo can use nunchucks now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.614" end="00:34:44.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.014" end="00:34:47.814" style="s2">A kangaroo with nunchucks? Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.714" end="00:34:47.814" style="s2">That&#39;s the whole reason I came today.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.214" end="00:34:51.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nunchucks?</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.714" end="00:34:55.114" style="s2">When did I ever</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.214" end="00:34:57.014" style="s2">buy him nunchucks?</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.114" end="00:34:58.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t get a crowd like this every day.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.014" end="00:35:00.314" style="s2">Can&#39;t embarrass myself now. More</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.814" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">practice tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.314" end="00:35:06.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is insane. Now that&#39;s real kung fu.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:08.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, foolish humans. Watch</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.214" end="00:35:09.414" style="s2">closely. This is what a true master</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.314" end="00:35:13.614" style="s2">looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:13.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? This actually works?</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.914" end="00:35:17.614" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.314" end="00:35:20.714" style="s2">now I finally understand why he loves</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.614" end="00:35:20.714" style="s2">those movies so much.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.914" end="00:35:23.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.414" end="00:35:25.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s the feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.014" end="00:35:29.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not just obsessed with fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.414" end="00:35:30.014" style="s2">This kangaroo is desperate to be famous.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.429" end="00:35:31.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.014" end="00:35:33.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we sure he&#39;s from Australia? Because</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.814" end="00:35:35.314" style="s2">he looks like he graduated from a</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.014" end="00:35:37.214" style="s2">martial arts school. Keep filming.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.314" end="00:35:39.714" style="s2">A kangaroo doing nunchucks? That video</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.214" end="00:35:41.914" style="s2">is going viral for sure.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.714" end="00:35:43.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, that&#39;s it. Get a good shot. And</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.914" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">don&#39;t you dare make me look ugly.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.514" end="00:35:47.514" style="s2">Humans, behold my greatness.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.814" end="00:35:48.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s definitely weird, but I have to</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.514" end="00:35:50.414" style="s2">admit</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.514" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">he&#39;s got star power.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.414" end="00:35:55.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is going on at this zoo? Why does</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:56.514" style="s2">every animal here have some kind of act?</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.414" end="00:35:58.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like to know the answer to that,</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.514" end="00:35:59.814" style="s2">too. These animals come up with more</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:01.614" style="s2">ideas in one day than I do as the zoo</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.814" end="00:36:03.514" style="s2">director.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.614" end="00:36:06.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember this magnificent sight. From</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.514" end="00:36:09.414" style="s2">now on, I am the strongest kung fu</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.114" end="00:36:09.414" style="s2">superstar in this zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.314" end="00:36:14.214" style="s2">The hottest animal online right now</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.414" end="00:36:16.414" style="s2">isn&#39;t a panda or a Siberian tiger. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.214" end="00:36:18.514" style="s2">a kung fu kangaroo. Where is this zoo? A</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.414" end="00:36:20.114" style="s2">Siberian tiger and a kung fu kangaroo?</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.514" end="00:36:21.214" style="s2">I&#39;m going this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.114" end="00:36:22.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.214" end="00:36:24.414" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this the zoo where that pretty</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.714" end="00:36:26.114" style="s2">director smacked a white tiger a while</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.414" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.114" end="00:36:30.114" style="s2">That&#39;s her. The Siberian tiger acts like</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.414" end="00:36:32.714" style="s2">a house cat around her, and now she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.114" end="00:36:34.514" style="s2">turned a kangaroo into a star.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.714" end="00:36:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget the animals. Isn&#39;t the director</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.514" end="00:36:37.514" style="s2">the craziest one?</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.914" end="00:36:38.814" style="s2">Why does every animal nobody else wants</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.514" end="00:36:41.214" style="s2">turn into a performer the second she</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.814" end="00:36:41.214" style="s2">gets it?</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.714" end="00:36:46.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I seeing this right?</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.314" end="00:36:47.616" style="s2">Ticket sales quarter are 10 times higher</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.316" end="00:36:50.016" style="s2">than last month.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.616" end="00:36:52.016" style="s2">Max is my lucky cat, and that kangaroo</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.016" end="00:36:54.916" style="s2">is a money printing machine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.016" end="00:36:56.216" style="s2">The zoo is really alive again.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.916" end="00:36:57.616" style="s2">At this rate,</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.216" end="00:37:01.316" style="s2">in a few more months I&#39;ll be able to</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.616" end="00:37:01.316" style="s2">renovate every habitat in the park.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.016" end="00:37:09.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Michael Grant, get your ass in here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.816" end="00:37:14.116" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you swear that kangaroo was going</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:15.316" style="s2">to die? Then what the hell is this? Not</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.116" end="00:37:16.016" style="s2">only is he alive, he&#39;s bringing in</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.316" end="00:37:17.816" style="s2">crowds.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.016" end="00:37:19.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I I can&#39;t explain it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.816" end="00:37:20.616" style="s2">Based on every medical indicator at the</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.216" end="00:37:22.316" style="s2">time, he genuinely appeared to be near</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.616" end="00:37:23.416" style="s2">death. She must have used some kind of</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.316" end="00:37:25.316" style="s2">specialized treatment method I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.416" end="00:37:26.916" style="s2">unfamiliar with.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.316" end="00:37:28.640" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:37:26.916" end="00:37:30.316" style="s2">You didn&#39;t know what you were doing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.640" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">[snorts] Stop making excuses.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.316" end="00:37:34.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But this truly contradicts everything we</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.316" end="00:37:37.016" style="s2">know about treating psychological</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.316" end="00:37:38.516" style="s2">disorders in animals.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.016" end="00:37:39.916" style="s2">Look at them yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.516" end="00:37:42.316" style="s2">He&#39;s swinging those new chucks with more</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.916" end="00:37:43.416" style="s2">energy than my employees show at work.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.316" end="00:37:44.716" style="s2">Does that look psychologically</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.416" end="00:37:46.216" style="s2">debilitated to you?</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.716" end="00:37:49.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This goes against every veterinary</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.216" end="00:37:49.116" style="s2">theory I was taught.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.716" end="00:37:53.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.316" end="00:37:55.616" style="s2">Emma Carter was right about you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.716" end="00:37:57.216" style="s2">You&#39;re a half-baked expert.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.616" end="00:37:58.616" style="s2">Look at these numbers.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.216" end="00:38:00.716" style="s2">Do you see how many visitors we&#39;ve lost</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.616" end="00:38:02.016" style="s2">lately? 80%.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.716" end="00:38:04.016" style="s2">Are you all trying to put this zoo out</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.016" end="00:38:05.716" style="s2">of business?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.016" end="00:38:07.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, we ran the numbers.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.716" end="00:38:10.116" style="s2">Most of the visitors we lost went to</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.116" end="00:38:11.516" style="s2">Carter Wildlife Park.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.116" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All because of that kangaroo with the</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.516" end="00:38:14.816" style="s2">nunchucks?</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.116" end="00:38:16.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not just the kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.816" end="00:38:18.316" style="s2">That Siberian tiger from a while back</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.416" end="00:38:19.816" style="s2">has a huge following now, too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.316" end="00:38:21.516" style="s2">Together they&#39;ve pulled away a massive</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.816" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">share of our visitors.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.516" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">On short video platforms especially,</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.716" end="00:38:27.016" style="s2">people are calling Carter Wildlife Park</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">the zoo where every animal seems to have</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.016" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">a personality.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.316" end="00:38:33.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two animals nobody wanted, and that damn</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.816" end="00:38:36.016" style="s2">girl actually used them to bring her</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.616" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">whole zoo back to life.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.016" end="00:38:39.116" style="s2">Keep this up,</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:40.916" style="s2">and nobody will care about the expensive</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.116" end="00:38:43.916" style="s2">animals we imported while her pack of</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.916" end="00:38:45.716" style="s2">freaks stays sold out every day.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.916" end="00:38:47.417" style="s2">I&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.716" end="00:38:48.817" style="s2">Since she loves taking in crazy animals</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.417" end="00:38:51.117" style="s2">so much,</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.817" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">let&#39;s give her exactly what she wants.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:54.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.417" end="00:38:56.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact the black market animal dealers</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.017" end="00:38:58.217" style="s2">in South Asia.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.317" end="00:38:59.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The black market? Jason, that&#39;s a risky</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.217" end="00:39:00.117" style="s2">channel.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.117" end="00:39:01.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the point. I want something you</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.117" end="00:39:03.217" style="s2">can&#39;t buy through normal channels. Emma</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:04.417" style="s2">Carter claims she can handle any animal,</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.217" end="00:39:06.117" style="s2">right? Then I&#39;ll send her a real</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.417" end="00:39:07.917" style="s2">lunatic. Find me the most dangerous,</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.117" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">uncontrollable animal you can, the kind</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.917" end="00:39:11.117" style="s2">even the world&#39;s best animal behavior</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.417" end="00:39:12.517" style="s2">experts can&#39;t manage.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.017" style="s2">Let&#39;s see if her so-called luck saves</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.517" end="00:39:15.017" style="s2">her this time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.117" end="00:39:19.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We broke another zoo record yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.517" end="00:39:19.917" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.117" end="00:39:24.117" style="s2">What&#39;s the number this time?</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.017" end="00:39:26.517" style="s2">10,000 tickets in one day. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.117" end="00:39:27.917" style="s2">$500,000 in ticket revenue alone, not</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.517" end="00:39:28.917" style="s2">counting anything visitors spent inside</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.917" end="00:39:30.817" style="s2">the park.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.917" end="00:39:32.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.817" end="00:39:33.917" style="s2">We used to go 6 months without selling</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.117" end="00:39:35.217" style="s2">that many.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.917" end="00:39:36.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.217" end="00:39:38.117" style="s2">Put half the profit back into renovating</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.717" end="00:39:40.417" style="s2">the habitats and upgrading equipment and</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:41.517" style="s2">keep enough in reserve for operations.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.417" end="00:39:43.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half?</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.517" end="00:39:45.717" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that a little much?</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.517" end="00:39:46.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can make more money later.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.717" end="00:39:48.217" style="s2">The animals shouldn&#39;t have to keep</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.717" end="00:39:49.217" style="s2">making do.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.217" end="00:39:51.417" style="s2">If they&#39;re the reason we&#39;re earning</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.217" end="00:39:52.917" style="s2">money, then their comfort comes first.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.417" end="00:39:54.417" style="s2">Upgrade the fencing, drainage, medical</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.917" end="00:39:56.117" style="s2">equipment, and care standards exactly as</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.417" end="00:39:57.217" style="s2">planned. Don&#39;t cut corners on the</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.117" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">animals.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.217" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.317" end="00:40:02.717" style="s2">I&#39;ll get it started today.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.117" end="00:40:04.917" style="s2">There&#39;s one more thing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.717" end="00:40:06.017" style="s2">Jason contacted me a while ago.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.917" end="00:40:07.807" style="s2">He says he wants to arrange a friendly</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.017" end="00:40:08.917" style="s2">exchange with us.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.807" end="00:40:11.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.917" end="00:40:13.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A friendly exchange?</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.117" end="00:40:14.517" style="s2">Since when is he that generous?</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:15.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re willing to send us an Asian</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.517" end="00:40:17.217" style="s2">elephant.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.617" end="00:40:18.717" style="s2">They recently imported for a 3-month</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.217" end="00:40:21.517" style="s2">exchange, and they&#39;ll cover</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.717" end="00:40:23.317" style="s2">transportation, food, medical care, and</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:25.417" style="s2">every other living expense for the full</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.317" end="00:40:26.917" style="s2">3 months.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.417" end="00:40:28.817" style="s2">He&#39;s lending his star animal to a</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.917" end="00:40:30.817" style="s2">competitor for free</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.817" end="00:40:33.017" style="s2">and paying every expense. If Jason Blake</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.817" end="00:40:34.617" style="s2">suddenly became that generous, the sun</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.017" end="00:40:36.417" style="s2">would rise in the west.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.617" end="00:40:39.517" style="s2">I thought it sounded strange, too, so I</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.417" end="00:40:39.517" style="s2">haven&#39;t agreed to anything.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.017" end="00:40:45.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The offer is way too good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.317" end="00:40:45.517" style="s2">There has to be something wrong with it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.017" end="00:40:52.818" style="s2">Uncle John, it&#39;s Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.318" end="00:40:54.518" style="s2">I need to ask you something about Jason</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.818" end="00:40:55.818" style="s2">Blake. Does Jason Blake have an Asian</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.518" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">elephant he recently brought in from</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.818" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">overseas?</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.518" end="00:41:01.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, he does. Why?</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.918" end="00:41:02.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His people contacted me. They want to</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.718" end="00:41:04.118" style="s2">sell the elephant to my zoo for a</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.918" end="00:41:05.418" style="s2">three-month exchange and they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.118" end="00:41:06.318" style="s2">offering to pay every expense.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.418" end="00:41:07.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.318" end="00:41:08.918" style="s2">Jason Blake wants to send that elephant</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.918" end="00:41:11.118" style="s2">to you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.918" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you reacting like that?</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.118" end="00:41:13.318" style="s2">Is there something wrong with the</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.918" end="00:41:15.418" style="s2">elephant?</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.318" end="00:41:17.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something wrong, Emma? Do not agree to</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.418" end="00:41:19.818" style="s2">this lightly. That man is absolutely up</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.918" end="00:41:20.918" style="s2">to something.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:22.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.918" end="00:41:24.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason got that Asian elephant a little</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.718" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">over a month ago through some special</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.318" end="00:41:28.818" style="s2">channels in South Asia. He planned to</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:30.518" style="s2">train it for a big animal show and use</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.818" end="00:41:32.818" style="s2">the act to win back the visitors he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.518" end="00:41:35.318" style="s2">lost to you. But nobody expected the</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.818" end="00:41:38.318" style="s2">elephant to be anything but normal.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.318" end="00:41:40.118" style="s2">Now nobody even dares get close to it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.318" end="00:41:43.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How crazy are we talking?</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.118" end="00:41:44.918" style="s2">It can&#39;t be worse than Max was.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.318" end="00:41:46.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Compared to this elephant, Max had a</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.918" end="00:41:48.118" style="s2">sweet temper.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.318" end="00:41:50.318" style="s2">Once this animal loses control, it</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.118" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">doesn&#39;t recognize anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.318" end="00:41:54.118" style="s2">In just half a week, it has attacked a</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.918" end="00:41:55.118" style="s2">bunch of large animals and several were</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.118" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">badly injured.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.118" end="00:41:59.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about people?</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:41:59.618" style="s2">Has it attacked trainers?</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.159" end="00:42:00.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.618" end="00:42:02.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.818" end="00:42:04.218" style="s2">Several of the trainers assigned to it</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.218" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">have already been hospitalized.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.218" end="00:42:07.718" style="s2">Now their staff won&#39;t even go near it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:08.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they still want to send an animal</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.718" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">like that</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:11.618" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:14.818" style="s2">No wonder they&#39;re willing to pay for the</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.618" end="00:42:14.818" style="s2">food and medical care, too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.118" end="00:42:19.018" style="s2">This isn&#39;t an exchange.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.518" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">They&#39;re trying to dump a ticking time</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.018" end="00:42:22.418" style="s2">bomb on me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.418" end="00:42:23.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, I know you helped Max and handled</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.418" end="00:42:25.718" style="s2">that kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.818" end="00:42:27.418" style="s2">You&#39;ve clearly got talent.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.718" end="00:42:29.118" style="s2">But this is different.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.418" end="00:42:31.218" style="s2">That elephant is already infamous in the</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.118" end="00:42:33.118" style="s2">zoo world. Everybody who hears about it</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.218" end="00:42:35.318" style="s2">gets a headache. Don&#39;t think you can</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:36.918" style="s2">tame it the way you handled the others.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.318" end="00:42:39.818" style="s2">That thing is a walking disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.918" end="00:42:41.718" style="s2">Anybody who gets close gets hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.818" end="00:42:42.918" style="s2">Emma, seriously, don&#39;t touch this one</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.718" end="00:42:44.718" style="s2">casually.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.918" end="00:42:46.418" style="s2">Jason is lending it to you for free and</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.718" end="00:42:47.718" style="s2">covering transportation, food, and</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.418" end="00:42:50.518" style="s2">medical care.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.718" end="00:42:52.718" style="s2">He&#39;s obviously setting a trap.</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.518" end="00:42:55.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know he doesn&#39;t mean well.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.718" end="00:42:56.720" style="s2">But the offer is so generous that now</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.620" end="00:42:58.620" style="s2">I really want to know what&#39;s wrong with</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.720" end="00:42:59.920" style="s2">the elephant.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.620" end="00:43:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All I know is that before every</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.920" end="00:43:03.420" style="s2">so-called episode, the elephant goes</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.520" end="00:43:04.920" style="s2">through the same motions.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.420" end="00:43:07.120" style="s2">it lifts a leg,</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.920" end="00:43:09.320" style="s2">lowers its head.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.120" end="00:43:11.120" style="s2">both front legs slowly bend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.320" end="00:43:13.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.120" end="00:43:14.820" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t charge right away?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.120" end="00:43:16.620" style="s2">Every time it&#39;s lift the leg, lower the</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.820" end="00:43:17.620" style="s2">head, bend the knees, pretty much in</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.620" end="00:43:19.520" style="s2">that order?</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.620" end="00:43:20.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty much.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.520" end="00:43:23.420" style="s2">That&#39;s why the second anyone sees it</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.920" end="00:43:26.820" style="s2">lift a leg, everybody backs away.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.420" end="00:43:26.820" style="s2">Nobody wants to wait for the charge.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.320" end="00:43:30.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But does it actually attack every time</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.720" end="00:43:32.020" style="s2">after doing those movements?</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.420" end="00:43:33.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not always.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.020" end="00:43:35.120" style="s2">Sometimes nothing happens.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.820" end="00:43:37.320" style="s2">It just stands there for a while and</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.120" end="00:43:38.420" style="s2">stops.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.320" end="00:43:39.920" style="s2">But who&#39;s going to risk their life to</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.420" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">find out?</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.920" end="00:43:45.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The movements are always the same,</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:48.220" style="s2">but an attack doesn&#39;t always follow.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.620" end="00:43:50.520" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t sound like simple rage.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.220" end="00:43:51.720" style="s2">Visitor numbers are finally stable.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.520" end="00:43:53.520" style="s2">We don&#39;t need to risk everything for</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.720" end="00:43:56.320" style="s2">another dangerous animal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.520" end="00:43:57.920" style="s2">This isn&#39;t about hype anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.320" end="00:44:00.120" style="s2">If the elephant is truly dangerous, I</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.920" end="00:44:01.320" style="s2">won&#39;t bring it home.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.120" end="00:44:02.820" style="s2">But the more everyone insists it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.320" end="00:44:05.720" style="s2">crazy,</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:07.220" style="s2">the more I want to know why.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.720" end="00:44:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t assume Max and the kangaroo</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.220" end="00:44:10.920" style="s2">prepared you for this.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.120" end="00:44:13.420" style="s2">An adult Asian elephant weighs several</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.920" end="00:44:15.120" style="s2">tons. If it really loses control,</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.420" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">neither a fence or a person is going to</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.120" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.220" end="00:44:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.820" end="00:44:20.820" style="s2">I &#39;m only going to look.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.520" end="00:44:22.520" style="s2">Until I know what&#39;s happening, I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.820" end="00:44:23.720" style="s2">sign a transfer or bring it back to my</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.520" end="00:44:26.020" style="s2">zoo.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.720" end="00:44:28.500" style="s2">I&#39;m not tired of living yet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.020" end="00:44:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are just like your dad.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.500" end="00:44:31.820" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] The more people tell</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.720" end="00:44:35.320" style="s2">you something can&#39;t be done, the more</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.820" end="00:44:35.320" style="s2">you have to see it with your own eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.320" end="00:44:40.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A free animal plus all those expenses</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.020" end="00:44:41.720" style="s2">covered?</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.120" end="00:44:44.720" style="s2">Jason really is terrified. I might say</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.720" end="00:44:46.320" style="s2">no. So we&#39;re actually going? We are.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.720" end="00:44:47.420" style="s2">First thing tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.320" end="00:44:48.820" style="s2">If he&#39;s gone to all this trouble to</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.420" end="00:44:49.920" style="s2">build a stage,</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.820" end="00:44:52.320" style="s2">I might as well see what show he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.920" end="00:44:52.320" style="s2">planning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.520" end="00:44:56.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.420" end="00:44:58.021" style="s2">I figured John would warned you and</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.821" end="00:45:00.421" style="s2">you&#39;d be too scared to come once you</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.021" end="00:45:01.621" style="s2">heard about this elephant.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.421" end="00:45:03.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re willing to lend me an Asian</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.621" end="00:45:05.221" style="s2">elephant for three months for free.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.921" end="00:45:07.321" style="s2">It&#39;d be rude not to come appreciate your</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.221" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">generosity.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.321" end="00:45:13.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three month exchange. Transportation,</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:13.021" style="s2">feed, and medical costs are all on us.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.121" end="00:45:16.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if the elephant injures someone,</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.821" end="00:45:18.421" style="s2">damages the habitat, or causes any other</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.621" end="00:45:21.021" style="s2">accident while it&#39;s at my zoo, I&#39;m fully</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.421" end="00:45:21.021" style="s2">responsible?</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.321" end="00:45:26.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The animal is in your zoo. So, of course</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.321" end="00:45:27.321" style="s2">you&#39;re responsible.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.121" end="00:45:30.321" style="s2">What if it knocks down your wall? You</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.321" end="00:45:30.321" style="s2">expect me to pay for it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.621" end="00:45:33.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wrote the liability section awfully</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.121" end="00:45:34.521" style="s2">clean,</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:36.621" style="s2">which tells me you know better than</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.521" end="00:45:37.821" style="s2">anyone that something may go wrong. So</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.621" end="00:45:39.921" style="s2">quit pretending this is a normal</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.821" end="00:45:41.521" style="s2">exchange.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.921" end="00:45:42.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a few lines in a contract scared</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.521" end="00:45:43.521" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.421" end="00:45:45.221" style="s2">If you don&#39;t have the guts to sign,</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.521" end="00:45:46.821" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.221" end="00:45:49.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll sign,</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.821" end="00:45:50.721" style="s2">but I&#39;m adding one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.621" end="00:45:52.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What condition?</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.721" end="00:45:55.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;ve concealed any illness,</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.621" end="00:45:57.021" style="s2">old injury, inappropriate training,</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.421" end="00:45:58.321" style="s2">or problems with the animal&#39;s sourcing</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.021" end="00:46:01.621" style="s2">or paperwork,</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.321" end="00:46:01.621" style="s2">the liability stays with you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.721" end="00:46:05.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Add it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.321" end="00:46:07.721" style="s2">It&#39;s just a crazy elephant. I have</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.021" end="00:46:07.721" style="s2">nothing to hide.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.421" end="00:46:12.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The contract is signed.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.221" end="00:46:13.721" style="s2">Now take me to the crazy elephant nobody</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.721" end="00:46:15.421" style="s2">dares touch.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.721" end="00:46:16.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just remember,</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.421" end="00:46:19.121" style="s2">when this one goes off, it&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.821" end="00:46:22.321" style="s2">like your Siberian tiger or kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.121" end="00:46:25.421" style="s2">Once we&#39;re there, follow instructions</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.321" end="00:46:25.421" style="s2">and don&#39;t try to play hero.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.221" end="00:46:30.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.521" end="00:46:32.721" style="s2">I don&#39;t gamble with safety.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.121" end="00:46:33.921" style="s2">But if that elephant isn&#39;t crazy at all,</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.721" end="00:46:36.921" style="s2">then everything you&#39;ve said today is</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.921" end="00:46:38.521" style="s2">going to look very interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.921" end="00:46:40.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; According to the records, it presents a</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.521" end="00:46:41.921" style="s2">high risk of aggression.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.221" end="00:46:44.221" style="s2">Once we enter the elephant area, do not</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:46.821" style="s2">approach it without authorization.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.221" end="00:46:48.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll listen to professional advice.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.821" end="00:46:51.121" style="s2">Just don&#39;t make the same mistake you</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.621" end="00:46:52.921" style="s2">made with the kangaroo.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.121" end="00:46:55.421" style="s2">Seeing the symptoms</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.921" end="00:46:57.323" style="s2">and never asking why.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.421" end="00:46:58.922" style="s2">This entire habitat is just for one</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.323" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">elephant. Where are the other Asian</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.922" end="00:47:02.323" style="s2">elephants?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.323" end="00:47:03.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It attacked other animals and injured</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.323" end="00:47:04.823" style="s2">trainers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.422" end="00:47:07.422" style="s2">For safety, we had no choice but to</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.823" end="00:47:07.422" style="s2">isolate it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.622" end="00:47:13.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. Everybody back up. It&#39;s starting</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.023" end="00:47:14.922" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.023" end="00:47:16.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It only lifted its leg.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.922" end="00:47:17.023" style="s2">Why are you so sure that&#39;s the beginning</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.223" end="00:47:19.323" style="s2">of an attack?</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.023" end="00:47:21.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That movement has repeatedly appeared</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.323" end="00:47:22.823" style="s2">before abnormal behavior.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.323" end="00:47:24.523" style="s2">Risk control means we don&#39;t wait until</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.823" end="00:47:26.922" style="s2">the animal actually charges before we</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.523" end="00:47:26.922" style="s2">move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.523" end="00:47:31.723" style="s2">Once it gets this far,</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.122" end="00:47:32.922" style="s2">we absolutely do not go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.723" end="00:47:35.323" style="s2">Sometimes it charges in the very next</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.922" end="00:47:35.323" style="s2">second.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:40.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those movements are too slow.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.622" end="00:47:42.523" style="s2">And every step looks like it&#39;s carefully</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.323" end="00:47:44.023" style="s2">controlling its balance.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.523" end="00:47:45.323" style="s2">That&#39;s nothing like an animal coiling up</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:47.223" style="s2">to charge.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.323" end="00:47:48.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, nothing to say now?</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.223" end="00:47:50.922" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you the one who understands</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.422" end="00:47:52.323" style="s2">animals? Tell us what&#39;s wrong with it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.922" end="00:47:53.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.323" end="00:47:55.122" style="s2">Why does that movement look so familiar?</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.922" end="00:47:56.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.122" end="00:47:58.122" style="s2">It may be entering an agitated state.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.723" end="00:47:59.723" style="s2">Nobody approach.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.122" end="00:48:00.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agitated? Its breathing is getting</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.723" end="00:48:02.723" style="s2">slower</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.922" end="00:48:05.323" style="s2">and its body isn&#39;t tense at all. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.723" end="00:48:06.922" style="s2">tell me this elephant is doing yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.323" end="00:48:08.422" style="s2">Every time it starts those movements,</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.922" end="00:48:09.422" style="s2">you all evacuate early?</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.422" end="00:48:11.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.422" end="00:48:13.023" style="s2">Nobody dares wait until it finishes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.622" end="00:48:17.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you may have never actually watched</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.023" end="00:48:18.723" style="s2">the full routine from beginning to end.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.023" end="00:48:20.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.723" end="00:48:21.122" style="s2">If something happens,</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.223" end="00:48:22.922" style="s2">don&#39;t say I didn&#39;t warn you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.122" end="00:48:24.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; step farther back. Once it finishes that</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.922" end="00:48:26.523" style="s2">movement, it may suddenly have an</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.023" end="00:48:26.523" style="s2">episode.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.723" end="00:48:31.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you humans be quiet for once? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.023" end="00:48:34.922" style="s2">trying to do yoga and you&#39;re ruining my</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.323" end="00:48:34.922" style="s2">breathing with all that noise.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.223" end="00:48:38.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.323" end="00:48:42.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can understand me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.223" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So lifting your leg, lowering your head</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.922" end="00:48:46.823" style="s2">and kneeling down, that was all yoga?</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.122" end="00:48:48.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else would it be? I&#39;m a giant</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.823" end="00:48:50.023" style="s2">elephant laying down like this. You</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.622" end="00:48:51.523" style="s2">think I&#39;m practicing somersaults?</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.023" end="00:48:52.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why does everyone say you go crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.523" end="00:48:54.323" style="s2">Do you know they run away every time you</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.723" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">start?</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.323" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re scared on their own.</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.723" end="00:49:00.124" style="s2">What does that have to do with me?</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.723" end="00:49:01.924" style="s2">Every</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.124" end="00:49:03.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m halfway through my practice, they</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.924" end="00:49:06.824" style="s2">come hovering around with sticks and</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.524" end="00:49:08.024" style="s2">metal hooks. It&#39;s unbelievably annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.824" end="00:49:10.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They used those things to train you</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.024" end="00:49:11.424" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.424" end="00:49:13.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah,</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.424" end="00:49:15.324" style="s2">but I don&#39;t like talking about the past.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.824" end="00:49:17.024" style="s2">It disturbs my peace of mind.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.324" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please stop stimulating the animal. It</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.024" end="00:49:20.124" style="s2">is clearly entering an alert state.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.724" end="00:49:21.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His state of mind is better than any of</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.124" end="00:49:24.024" style="s2">yours right now. What actually bothers</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.824" end="00:49:25.024" style="s2">him is the way you trained him before.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.024" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been looking at him for a few</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.024" end="00:49:27.624" style="s2">minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.224" end="00:49:29.424" style="s2">What gives you the right to decide where</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.624" end="00:49:30.924" style="s2">the problem</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.424" end="00:49:32.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because all of you were certain he was</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.924" end="00:49:35.324" style="s2">having an episode just now, and he</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.824" end="00:49:35.324" style="s2">wasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.624" end="00:49:38.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what do you think those movements</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.724" end="00:49:40.424" style="s2">are?</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.524" end="00:49:43.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.424" end="00:49:44.724" style="s2">He&#39;s been doing yoga this whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.124" end="00:49:46.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell did you just say?</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.724" end="00:49:48.524" style="s2">An elephant doing yoga?</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.324" end="00:49:50.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. The crazy elephant you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.524" end="00:49:52.524" style="s2">guarding against this whole time has</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.524" end="00:49:53.624" style="s2">actually been practicing yoga by himself</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.524" end="00:49:55.924" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.624" end="00:49:57.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But after those movements, he slams the</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.924" end="00:50:00.424" style="s2">gate and swings his trunk. How could it</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.724" end="00:50:03.024" style="s2">possibly be just yoga?</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.424" end="00:50:05.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you get angry after you finish?</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.024" end="00:50:06.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally get my breathing right, and</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.024" end="00:50:08.724" style="s2">then they rush at me with tools and try</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.624" end="00:50:10.224" style="s2">to drive me around. Wouldn&#39;t that annoy</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.724" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.224" end="00:50:13.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You interrupt his practice, then call</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.924" end="00:50:15.124" style="s2">the reaction a medical episode. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:16.309" style="s2">got cause and effect completely</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.124" end="00:50:16.524" style="s2">backwards.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.309" end="00:50:18.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:19.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma Carter, are you so desperate to</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.124" end="00:50:21.024" style="s2">look smarter than the experts that</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.524" end="00:50:22.424" style="s2">you&#39;ll seriously claim an elephant is</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.024" end="00:50:24.424" style="s2">doing yoga?</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.424" end="00:50:26.924" style="s2">Repeated stretching and fixed movement</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.424" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">patterns in animals can be stereotypic</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.924" end="00:50:30.124" style="s2">behavior.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.224" end="00:50:32.824" style="s2">Looking similar to yoga does not mean</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.124" end="00:50:34.424" style="s2">the animal understands yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.824" end="00:50:35.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They don&#39;t believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.424" end="00:50:37.524" style="s2">Where did you learn it? Don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.924" end="00:50:39.724" style="s2">you were born knowing how.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.524" end="00:50:42.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was young, there was an old man</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.724" end="00:50:44.624" style="s2">where I lived. Every morning at sunrise,</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.224" end="00:50:47.124" style="s2">he&#39;d lay out a mat, breathe first, then</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.624" end="00:50:49.124" style="s2">slowly stretch his arms and legs.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.124" end="00:50:50.524" style="s2">At first, I only watched.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.124" end="00:50:52.524" style="s2">Then I noticed that stretching along</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.524" end="00:50:54.300" style="s2">with him made my body feel good, so</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:55.024" style="s2">little by little I learned.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.300" end="00:50:56.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.024" end="00:50:56.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you learned it back where you grew</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.224" end="00:50:58.724" style="s2">up?</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.924" end="00:51:00.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lots of people there</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.724" end="00:51:01.724" style="s2">practiced it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.324" end="00:51:04.725" style="s2">Later I learned</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.724" end="00:51:06.125" style="s2">they called it yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.725" end="00:51:08.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you mumbling to yourself about</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.125" end="00:51:09.525" style="s2">over there?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.025" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When he was young,</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.525" end="00:51:13.125" style="s2">he watched people practice yoga and</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.925" end="00:51:14.325" style="s2">learned by copying them.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.125" end="00:51:16.225" style="s2">You thought lifting his leg was a</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:18.925" style="s2">warning sign before an attack.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.225" end="00:51:21.125" style="s2">It&#39;s actually just part of his routine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.925" end="00:51:22.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if imitation is involved, that does</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.125" end="00:51:24.325" style="s2">not mean the animal understands the</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.425" end="00:51:26.425" style="s2">purpose of the movements.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.325" end="00:51:27.325" style="s2">Animals imitating humans is not</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.425" end="00:51:29.025" style="s2">uncommon.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.325" end="00:51:30.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He controls his breathing on purpose,</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.025" end="00:51:32.225" style="s2">stretches in a specific sequence, and</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.525" end="00:51:33.525" style="s2">gets annoyed when you interrupt him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.225" end="00:51:36.825" style="s2">What do you want a yoga certification</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.525" end="00:51:36.825" style="s2">before you&#39;ll admit he understands it?</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.525" end="00:51:42.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could everybody be quiet? I still have</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.625" end="00:51:43.725" style="s2">one set left.</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.625" end="00:51:45.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He says you&#39;re too loud and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.725" end="00:51:47.625" style="s2">ruining his practice.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.025" end="00:51:49.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop screwing with me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.625" end="00:51:52.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Believe it or don&#39;t. At least I know</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.225" end="00:51:52.725" style="s2">he&#39;s not going crazy for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.525" end="00:51:58.625" style="s2">What happened to the old man?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.625" end="00:52:01.225" style="s2">Did you keep practicing with him?</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.625" end="00:52:03.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After they took me away,</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.225" end="00:52:05.625" style="s2">I never saw him again.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.225" end="00:52:07.625" style="s2">But I remembered all the movements.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.625" end="00:52:09.725" style="s2">When I&#39;m upset, practicing them makes me</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.625" end="00:52:11.925" style="s2">feel like I&#39;m back there again.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.725" end="00:52:13.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you weren&#39;t attacking for no reason,</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.925" end="00:52:16.025" style="s2">then what actually happened when those</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.125" end="00:52:16.025" style="s2">trainers got hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.425" end="00:52:19.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They forced me to do things I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.725" end="00:52:20.625" style="s2">want to do.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.025" style="s2">I never meant to hurt anyone in the</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.625" end="00:52:23.025" style="s2">beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.225" end="00:52:25.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like what?</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.525" end="00:52:30.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Balancing balls, kneeling, spinning in</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.025" end="00:52:32.025" style="s2">circles,</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.425" end="00:52:33.625" style="s2">even standing up on my hind legs for</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.025" end="00:52:34.925" style="s2">people to watch.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.625" end="00:52:36.225" style="s2">If I refused, they called me</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.925" end="00:52:37.625" style="s2">disobedient.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.225" end="00:52:39.825" style="s2">Then they started poking me with metal</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.625" end="00:52:41.125" style="s2">hooks, chaining me up, and deliberately</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.825" end="00:52:42.025" style="s2">frightening me until I finished the</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.125" end="00:52:43.225" style="s2">routine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.025" end="00:52:45.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.225" end="00:52:47.625" style="s2">that&#39;s why you attacked them?</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.125" end="00:52:49.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At first, I only pushed people away.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.625" end="00:52:51.325" style="s2">Then they decided I was resisting and</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.525" end="00:52:53.625" style="s2">brought in even more people.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.325" end="00:52:56.225" style="s2">Now the second I see those tools, all I</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.625" end="00:52:58.025" style="s2">want is to make them stay away from me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.225" end="00:53:00.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was he trained for circus-style</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.025" end="00:53:03.025" style="s2">performances before?</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.925" end="00:53:04.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We did arrange some interactive routines</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.025" end="00:53:06.027" style="s2">in in</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.425" end="00:53:08.627" style="s2">We gradually canceled them because he</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.027" end="00:53:11.127" style="s2">wasn&#39;t cooperative enough.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.627" end="00:53:12.727" style="s2">Training animals at a zoo is normal.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.127" end="00:53:16.227" style="s2">Don&#39;t hear voices in your own head and</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.727" end="00:53:16.227" style="s2">start calling everything abuse.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.127" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Training and forcing are two different</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.827" end="00:53:25.927" style="s2">things. He said no and you used pain and</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:27.027" style="s2">fear to make him obey.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.927" end="00:53:28.927" style="s2">You call that normal?</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.027" end="00:53:30.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Managing large animals requires clear</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.927" end="00:53:32.227" style="s2">boundaries.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.227" end="00:53:33.527" style="s2">Some behavioral guidance is necessary,</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.227" end="00:53:35.827" style="s2">otherwise staff safety cannot be</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.527" end="00:53:37.727" style="s2">guaranteed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.827" end="00:53:38.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does behavioral training have to involve</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.727" end="00:53:39.227" style="s2">metal hooks?</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.727" end="00:53:40.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.227" end="00:53:42.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it have to push an animal until it</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.727" end="00:53:46.027" style="s2">fights back? Giving it a professional</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.527" end="00:53:46.027" style="s2">sounding name doesn&#39;t make it okay.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.827" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What annoys the most is my yoga. They</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.427" end="00:53:52.462" style="s2">constantly come over and chase me around</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.927" end="00:53:53.727" style="s2">halfway through a session.</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.462" end="00:53:55.927" style="s2">[snorts] I finally get my breathing set</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.727" end="00:53:57.927" style="s2">it, then here come the sticks. Who</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.927" end="00:53:59.927" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be pissed off?</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.927" end="00:54:01.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve practiced yoga for years. How</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.927" end="00:54:03.527" style="s2">come it hasn&#39;t made your temper any</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.227" end="00:54:06.227" style="s2">softer?</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.527" end="00:54:09.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yoga is about peace. That doesn&#39;t mean I</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.227" end="00:54:10.327" style="s2">have to tolerate people hurting me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.127" end="00:54:11.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.327" end="00:54:14.827" style="s2">Swallowing your anger isn&#39;t the same</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.727" end="00:54:14.827" style="s2">thing as being at peace.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.027" end="00:54:19.127" style="s2">I think I understand now.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.027" end="00:54:22.127" style="s2">Yes, he can be dangerous,</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.127" end="00:54:24.427" style="s2">but the aggression isn&#39;t random.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.127" end="00:54:27.127" style="s2">You&#39;ve been confusing the triggers</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.427" end="00:54:28.227" style="s2">with the result this entire time.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.127" end="00:54:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stand there with him for a few</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.227" end="00:54:31.727" style="s2">minutes and suddenly every problem is</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.327" end="00:54:33.627" style="s2">our fault. How do we know you didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.727" end="00:54:36.027" style="s2">make up this whole yoga story? The data</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.627" end="00:54:37.127" style="s2">still shows a high risk of aggression.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.027" end="00:54:39.127" style="s2">Even if some of the movements are</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.127" end="00:54:40.027" style="s2">stretches, that alone doesn&#39;t rule out</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.127" end="00:54:41.927" style="s2">the danger.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.027" end="00:54:43.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before, lifting his leg automatically</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.927" end="00:54:44.827" style="s2">meant an episode.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.527" end="00:54:47.827" style="s2">Now that it doesn&#39;t, you immediately</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.827" end="00:54:49.727" style="s2">change the explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.827" end="00:54:51.727" style="s2">Is there a diagnosic</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.727" end="00:54:53.927" style="s2">for literally anything he does?</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.727" end="00:54:55.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scientific conclusions change when the</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.927" end="00:54:56.927" style="s2">evidence changes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.427" end="00:54:58.827" style="s2">A previous error does not mean every</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.927" end="00:55:00.827" style="s2">risk disappears.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.827" end="00:55:02.927" style="s2">If you&#39;re so sure he &#39;s doing yoga, make</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.827" end="00:55:04.627" style="s2">him do it for us right now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.927" end="00:55:06.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want you to do the routine once so</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.627" end="00:55:07.727" style="s2">they can see it. Do you want to?</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.727" end="00:55:08.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.727" end="00:55:12.328" style="s2">Why should</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.128" end="00:55:13.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; perform? Just because they told me to.</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.328" end="00:55:15.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He says he doesn&#39;t want to.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.828" end="00:55:16.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, I knew it. You just say he doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.228" end="00:55:17.628" style="s2">want to and suddenly you can explain</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.628" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">away anything.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.628" end="00:55:20.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going to force an animal that</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.028" end="00:55:21.928" style="s2">doesn&#39;t want to move just so I can prove</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.828" end="00:55:24.428" style="s2">I&#39;m right to you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.928" end="00:55:26.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without behavior we can verify.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.428" end="00:55:28.028" style="s2">Your conclusion will understandably be</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.028" end="00:55:30.728" style="s2">difficult for others to accept. These</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.028" end="00:55:32.628" style="s2">humans are noisier than monkeys.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.728" end="00:55:34.728" style="s2">Apparently I need credentials before I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.628" end="00:55:36.928" style="s2">allowed to do yoga now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.728" end="00:55:38.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to prove anything.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.928" end="00:55:39.728" style="s2">Practice if you want.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.428" end="00:55:41.528" style="s2">Rest if you don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.728" end="00:55:43.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they really want to watch, remove</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.528" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">every hook, chain, and training stick.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.828" end="00:55:46.128" style="s2">Then give me a place that doesn&#39;t hurt</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.128" end="00:55:48.928" style="s2">my feet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.128" end="00:55:50.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No commands, no food cues.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.928" end="00:55:52.128" style="s2">You&#39;ll practice the way you normally do</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.528" end="00:55:53.828" style="s2">by choice.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.128" end="00:55:54.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m willing to practice.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.828" end="00:55:56.328" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;m willing to be</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.928" end="00:55:58.028" style="s2">ordered around.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.328" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">When nobody forces me,</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.028" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">I do this every day anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.428" end="00:56:04.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remove all the training goals and put</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.528" end="00:56:07.628" style="s2">down a non-slip padded mat.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.928" end="00:56:08.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Removing outside stimulus and human cues</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.628" end="00:56:11.828" style="s2">will make it easier to determine whether</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.928" end="00:56:13.328" style="s2">the behavior is truly voluntary. Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.828" end="00:56:14.928" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you your chance.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:16.728" style="s2">But if that elephant loses it, the</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.928" end="00:56:18.628" style="s2">responsibility is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.728" end="00:56:20.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything has been removed. Everyone is</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.628" end="00:56:22.328" style="s2">behind the safety line.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.228" end="00:56:24.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody is giving you an order.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.328" end="00:56:26.628" style="s2">Practice if you want. If you don&#39;t, keep</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.528" end="00:56:29.628" style="s2">eating grass.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.628" end="00:56:31.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, some peace and quiet. Now this</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.628" end="00:56:33.528" style="s2">feels like a place where I can actually</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.728" end="00:56:34.828" style="s2">move comfortably.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.528" end="00:56:36.828" style="s2">You&#39;ve certainly made a production out</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.828" end="00:56:40.128" style="s2">of this. Let&#39;s see what trick the</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.828" end="00:56:40.128" style="s2">elephant supposedly has.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.729" end="00:56:48.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.728" end="00:56:49.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s done that movement before.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.628" end="00:56:52.128" style="s2">We always thought he was lining himself</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.928" end="00:56:54.028" style="s2">up to charge.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.128" end="00:56:55.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The movements clearly form a continuous</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.028" end="00:56:56.628" style="s2">sequence</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.128" end="00:56:58.128" style="s2">and there are no external commands at</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.628" end="00:56:59.928" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.128" end="00:57:01.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that much body weight, how can he</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.928" end="00:57:04.328" style="s2">control his balance so steadily?</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.728" end="00:57:06.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being large doesn&#39;t mean being clumsy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.328" end="00:57:08.728" style="s2">The hard part is control, not brute</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.328" end="00:57:08.728" style="s2">strength.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.028" end="00:57:14.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t that you never the movements.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.629" end="00:57:16.929" style="s2">You just never waited long enough to see</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.229" end="00:57:16.929" style="s2">him finish them.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.729" end="00:57:21.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Based on what we&#39;re seeing now, some of</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.829" end="00:57:23.229" style="s2">the earlier behavioral records may</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.629" end="00:57:24.829" style="s2">indeed have been misinterpreted.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.229" end="00:57:26.429" style="s2">Misinterpreted? An elephant stretches</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.829" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">his legs a few times and suddenly you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.429" end="00:57:29.929" style="s2">changing your story?</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.429" end="00:57:31.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop talking. I finally got my breathing</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.929" end="00:57:33.629" style="s2">right and now you&#39;re messing it up</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.329" end="00:57:35.629" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.629" end="00:57:37.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With that level of control, calling him</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.629" end="00:57:39.529" style="s2">a ticking time bomb all this time really</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.529" end="00:57:42.129" style="s2">was ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.529" end="00:57:43.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was only the warm up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.129" end="00:57:45.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he has practiced voluntarity for a</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.629" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">long time,</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.129" end="00:57:48.329" style="s2">it would not be surprising for his</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.329" end="00:57:50.329" style="s2">flexibility and coordination to be above</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.329" end="00:57:51.929" style="s2">average. Even if we confirm these</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.329" end="00:57:53.629" style="s2">movements are voluntary, that does not</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.929" end="00:57:55.129" style="s2">completely eliminate the possibility of</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.629" end="00:57:56.829" style="s2">aggression.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.129" end="00:57:58.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fair.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.829" end="00:57:59.529" style="s2">Every large animal carries potential</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.529" end="00:58:01.329" style="s2">risk.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.529" end="00:58:02.675" style="s2">But dangerous is not the same thing as</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.329" end="00:58:03.329" style="s2">crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.675" end="00:58:05.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.329" end="00:58:06.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After all that talking,</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.029" end="00:58:08.429" style="s2">he still hurts people. You&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.729" end="00:58:10.529" style="s2">changing the wording to make excuses for</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.429" end="00:58:10.529" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.129" end="00:58:14.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If somebody poked me with a metal hook</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.529" end="00:58:15.429" style="s2">every day, I might be more dangerous</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.329" end="00:58:17.329" style="s2">than he is.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.429" end="00:58:18.329" style="s2">Before you judge the animal,</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.329" end="00:58:20.729" style="s2">take a look at what the humans did</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.329" end="00:58:20.729" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.325" end="00:58:25.129" style="s2">[snorts] Want to go home and write a</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.529" end="00:58:27.129" style="s2">paper about it? You can call it</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.129" end="00:58:29.530" style="s2">self-directed yoga in Asian elephants, a</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.129" end="00:58:29.629" style="s2">case of misdiagnosed behavior.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.530" end="00:58:31.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.629" end="00:58:32.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If our earlier conclusions were wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.429" end="00:58:34.329" style="s2">then they should be corrected. Science</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.929" end="00:58:35.829" style="s2">is not about proving that one person is</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.329" end="00:58:37.729" style="s2">always right. Weren&#39;t you the one who</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.829" end="00:58:40.529" style="s2">wrote those earlier reports?</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.729" end="00:58:42.429" style="s2">And now suddenly they were wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.529" end="00:58:43.629" style="s2">You talk a lot, too.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.429" end="00:58:45.229" style="s2">But at least you don&#39;t use tools to</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.629" end="00:58:46.529" style="s2">force me around.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.229" end="00:58:48.829" style="s2">If I&#39;m going to live somewhere else, I</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.529" end="00:58:49.929" style="s2">have three conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.829" end="00:58:51.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.929" end="00:58:52.629" style="s2">As long as they&#39;re reasonable, we can</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.429" end="00:58:54.829" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.629" end="00:58:57.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, no chains.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.829" end="00:58:59.029" style="s2">Second, no forced performances.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.429" end="00:59:00.929" style="s2">Third, I need a quiet place every</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.029" end="00:59:02.129" style="s2">morning to practice yoga.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.929" end="00:59:03.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.129" end="00:59:05.129" style="s2">None of those are unreasonable in the</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.229" end="00:59:07.229" style="s2">first place.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.129" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the pool should be bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.229" end="00:59:10.629" style="s2">The one here is so small I can&#39;t stretch</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.929" end="00:59:12.629" style="s2">my legs when I lie down.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.629" end="00:59:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree to your conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.629" end="00:59:16.931" style="s2">At my zoo, there will be no chains and</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.331" end="00:59:19.031" style="s2">no forced routines at fixed times.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.931" end="00:59:21.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.031" end="00:59:22.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you have rules to follow, too.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.331" end="00:59:23.931" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to be the only one making</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.531" end="00:59:25.031" style="s2">demands.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.931" end="00:59:27.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.031" end="00:59:29.531" style="s2">they&#39;re reasonable, I&#39;ll agree.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.731" end="00:59:31.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t hurt people for no reason.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.531" end="00:59:32.631" style="s2">Second, don&#39;t bully other animals just</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.331" end="00:59:34.631" style="s2">because you&#39;re bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.631" end="00:59:35.531" style="s2">Third, if something feels wrong, tell me</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.631" end="00:59:37.131" style="s2">before you act.</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.531" end="00:59:38.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If nobody hurts me, I won&#39;t attack</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.131" end="00:59:39.831" style="s2">first. If there&#39;s [clears throat] a</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.431" end="00:59:40.731" style="s2">problem, I&#39;ll tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.831" end="00:59:42.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.731" end="00:59:44.531" style="s2">You follow the rules, and I&#39;ll keep my</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.031" end="00:59:44.531" style="s2">promises.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.631" end="00:59:46.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.731" end="00:59:48.531" style="s2">You&#39;re seriously taking that crazy</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.931" end="00:59:50.631" style="s2">elephant home?</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.531" end="00:59:53.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We already signed the contract.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.631" end="00:59:55.331" style="s2">You&#39;re not backing out now, are you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.331" end="00:59:56.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love for you to take him.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.331" end="00:59:59.131" style="s2">One good day doesn&#39;t mean he&#39;ll behave</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.731" end="01:00:00.576" style="s2">tomorrow. If anything happens, it&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.131" end="01:00:00.831" style="s2">your responsibility.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.576" end="01:00:02.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.831" end="01:00:03.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my zoo.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.131" end="01:00:05.231" style="s2">Of course I&#39;m responsible.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.731" end="01:00:07.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The transport still needs a complete</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.231" end="01:00:10.731" style="s2">safety plan, barriers, routes, emergency</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.831" end="01:00:13.231" style="s2">personnel, and a sedation contingency.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.731" end="01:00:14.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll follow standard safety procedures,</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.231" end="01:00:18.431" style="s2">but avoid aversive tools whenever</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.631" end="01:00:20.031" style="s2">possible, especially hooks and chains.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.431" end="01:00:21.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you think you&#39;re some kind of animal</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.031" end="01:00:22.631" style="s2">savior?</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.231" end="01:00:25.531" style="s2">A few gentle words and you think he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.631" end="01:00:26.831" style="s2">listen to you forever?</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.531" end="01:00:28.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not trying to make him listen to me</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.831" end="01:00:29.431" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.031" end="01:00:30.631" style="s2">I just think finding the cause is better</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.431" end="01:00:33.131" style="s2">than treating him like a criminal from</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.631" end="01:00:33.131" style="s2">the start.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.631" end="01:00:36.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are we leaving?</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.631" end="01:00:41.131" style="s2">The people here are too loud.</p>
<p begin="01:00:38.831" end="01:00:42.931" style="s2">I&#39;m sick of this place.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.131" end="01:00:44.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, we do a health exam and a</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.931" end="01:00:47.431" style="s2">transport assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.631" end="01:00:49.731" style="s2">If everything checks out, we leave.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.431" end="01:00:52.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the new place, I&#39;d prefer an</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.731" end="01:00:54.231" style="s2">east-facing lawn.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.031" end="01:00:56.931" style="s2">Morning sunlight feels good.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.231" end="01:00:58.831" style="s2">And don&#39;t make the pool too small.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.931" end="01:01:00.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve got a lawn and a pool.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.831" end="01:01:02.147" style="s2">The yoga area will take some time to</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.231" end="01:01:04.167" style="s2">upgrade.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.147" end="01:01:04.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.131" end="01:01:11.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you bring home this time? Why</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.831" end="01:01:13.331" style="s2">is it so huge? Does it eat chicken? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.131" end="01:01:15.331" style="s2">saying this now, my hens are mine. Too</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.331" end="01:01:15.432" style="s2">dow. Nobody gets a share.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.331" end="01:01:17.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.432" end="01:01:19.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; eats plants. Nobody is stealing your</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.432" end="01:01:20.432" style="s2">chicken. Is food seriously all you think</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.332" end="01:01:21.632" style="s2">about?</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.432" end="01:01:23.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right then.</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.632" end="01:01:24.732" style="s2">Anybody who doesn&#39;t steal my food is a</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.032" end="01:01:27.032" style="s2">good buddy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.732" end="01:01:29.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that size. Those shoulders. Now</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.032" end="01:01:30.932" style="s2">that looks like a legendary fighter.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.232" end="01:01:33.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stay right there. I just brought him</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.932" end="01:01:34.632" style="s2">home. No picking fights today.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.432" end="01:01:35.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big guy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.632" end="01:01:37.032" style="s2">I heard you put a lot of people in the</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.932" end="01:01:39.032" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.032" end="01:01:40.732" style="s2">You want to go a couple rounds with me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.032" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.732" end="01:01:46.232" style="s2">I practice yoga. I don&#39;t like fighting.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.332" end="01:01:48.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re built like that and you do yoga?</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.232" end="01:01:49.632" style="s2">Train kung fu with me and you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.032" end="01:01:50.932" style="s2">dominate this whole zoo.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.632" end="01:01:52.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Throwing punches doesn&#39;t make you</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.932" end="01:01:54.632" style="s2">strong.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.232" end="01:01:55.932" style="s2">Real strength is controlling your body</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.632" end="01:01:57.832" style="s2">and your emotions.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.932" end="01:01:59.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you saying I can&#39;t control myself?</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.832" end="01:02:00.832" style="s2">Boss, don&#39;t stop me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.532" end="01:02:03.732" style="s2">I&#39;m going to show this guy what a real</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.832" end="01:02:06.332" style="s2">master looks like.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.732" end="01:02:07.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get back where you belong.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.332" end="01:02:09.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big guy.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.647" end="01:02:10.832" style="s2">[snorts] This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.132" end="01:02:12.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too much energy,</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.832" end="01:02:14.332" style="s2">not enough calm.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.432" end="01:02:16.832" style="s2">He really should try yoga.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.332" end="01:02:18.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to watch too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.832" end="01:02:19.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One of these days</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.532" end="01:02:21.832" style="s2">you animals are going to yell this whole</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.932" end="01:02:23.732" style="s2">zoo apart.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.832" end="01:02:26.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The air is nice in the morning here and</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.732" end="01:02:28.132" style="s2">the sunlight is just right.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.332" end="01:02:29.632" style="s2">I don&#39;t mind that the place is old as</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.132" end="01:02:32.332" style="s2">long as it&#39;s quiet and someone is</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.632" end="01:02:34.032" style="s2">willing to keep improving it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.332" end="01:02:36.132" style="s2">He&#39;s been holding that leg up forever.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.032" end="01:02:37.632" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t it go numb? I am tired just</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.132" end="01:02:39.232" style="s2">looking at him.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.632" end="01:02:41.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s practicing yoga.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.232" end="01:02:43.332" style="s2">Keep it down before you annoy him again.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.332" end="01:02:44.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does yoga help you lose weight?</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.332" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">Lately I feel heavier every time I run a</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.932" end="01:02:48.832" style="s2">few steps.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.032" end="01:02:50.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eating two fewer chickens a day would</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.832" end="01:02:52.632" style="s2">help you more than any yoga ever could.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.932" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never mind then.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.632" end="01:02:57.032" style="s2">A little extra weight gives me presence.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.132" end="01:02:59.032" style="s2">Tigers are supposed to have some heft.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.032" end="01:03:01.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it. Standing around with one leg</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.032" end="01:03:02.132" style="s2">up counts as skill. I can stand on one</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.032" end="01:03:03.932" style="s2">foot all day.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.132" end="01:03:05.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then try it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.932" end="01:03:08.132" style="s2">Don&#39;t just stand there talking.</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.832" end="01:03:09.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch closely. This is what body control</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:12.032" style="s2">looks like from the king of land</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.632" end="01:03:12.032" style="s2">fighting.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.232" end="01:03:15.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.932" end="01:03:17.833" style="s2">Why is the king of fighters face down on</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.532" end="01:03:19.333" style="s2">the ground? Need me to help you up?</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.833" end="01:03:20.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That didn&#39;t count. The ground&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.333" end="01:03:23.533" style="s2">problem. Again.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.933" end="01:03:25.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t force it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.533" end="01:03:27.833" style="s2">Slow your breathing first, then settle</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.633" end="01:03:29.733" style="s2">your center of gravity.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.833" end="01:03:32.333" style="s2">The more you rush, the less stable</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.733" end="01:03:32.333" style="s2">you&#39;ll be.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.798" end="01:03:34.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.833" end="01:03:36.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.133" end="01:03:37.133" style="s2">I got the whole thing on video. Next</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.033" end="01:03:39.233" style="s2">time you brag about being number one in</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.133" end="01:03:41.633" style="s2">the world, I&#39;m putting this on a loop.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.233" end="01:03:43.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t film that. It&#39;s my FIRST TIME. I</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.633" end="01:03:45.633" style="s2">DON&#39;T know the rules yet.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.633" end="01:03:47.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your punches are fast, but your mind</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.633" end="01:03:49.933" style="s2">rushes even faster. When you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.533" end="01:03:52.433" style="s2">impatient, your body will never truly be</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.933" end="01:03:52.433" style="s2">steady.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.133" end="01:03:58.033" style="s2">Slow down. Yoga isn&#39;t a competition. If</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.333" end="01:03:59.933" style="s2">all you think about is winning, your</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.033" end="01:04:01.233" style="s2">body will never relax.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.933" end="01:04:02.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point of practicing something</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.233" end="01:04:04.433" style="s2">if it&#39;s not a competition? I have to be</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.933" end="01:04:06.333" style="s2">number one at everything.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.433" end="01:04:07.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your greatest opponent has never been</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.333" end="01:04:10.933" style="s2">anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.933" end="01:04:11.833" style="s2">It&#39;s your own impatience.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.933" end="01:04:12.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="01:04:11.833" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">That actually sounds like something a</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.733" end="01:04:18.233" style="s2">champion fighter would say. Big guy, you</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.133" end="01:04:18.233" style="s2">really do know a thing or two.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.233" end="01:04:23.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quick, film this. The Kung Fu Kangaroo</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.133" end="01:04:24.033" style="s2">is actually doing yoga with the</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.333" end="01:04:25.733" style="s2">elephant.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.033" end="01:04:27.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king of land fighting and the yoga</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.733" end="01:04:30.133" style="s2">elephant, this combo is ridiculous. Make</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.833" end="01:04:31.433" style="s2">sure I look good. This is my new</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.133" end="01:04:33.933" style="s2">signature move.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.433" end="01:04:37.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get distracted. Your breathing</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.933" end="01:04:37.233" style="s2">just got messy again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.533" end="01:04:41.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you laughing at? I was testing</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.333" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">the ground. A true master always studies</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.433" end="01:04:44.133" style="s2">the conditions.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.033" end="01:04:47.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody used to crowd around taking</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.533" end="01:04:49.333" style="s2">pictures of me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.833" end="01:04:50.744" style="s2">Now they&#39;re all watching those two lift</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.333" end="01:04:52.533" style="s2">their legs.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.744" end="01:04:55.433" style="s2">[snorts] Nobody cares about a Siberian</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.533" end="01:04:55.433" style="s2">tiger anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.633" end="01:05:00.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least they actually do something.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.733" end="01:05:01.233" style="s2">All you do is eat and sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.033" end="01:05:03.333" style="s2">If somebody films you for an hour,</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.233" end="01:05:06.033" style="s2">they&#39;re lucky to get 10 useful seconds.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.333" end="01:05:09.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s called dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.033" end="01:05:11.033" style="s2">A real boss doesn&#39;t need to move around.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.433" end="01:05:13.433" style="s2">I can lie here and still command the</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.033" end="01:05:13.433" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.533" end="01:05:18.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Kung Fu Kangaroo is learning yoga,</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.833" end="01:05:20.735" style="s2">and the elephant is his coach. What kind</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.733" end="01:05:22.535" style="s2">of magical zoo is this?</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.735" end="01:05:24.435" style="s2">This place again. Does that director</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.535" end="01:05:26.435" style="s2">specialize in collecting weird animals</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.435" end="01:05:28.235" style="s2">or something?</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.435" end="01:05:29.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s advanced ticket sales doubled.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.235" end="01:05:31.135" style="s2">That video did more for us than paid</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.435" end="01:05:33.035" style="s2">advertising.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.135" end="01:05:34.535" style="s2">Handle visitors as usual.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.035" end="01:05:35.935" style="s2">Don&#39;t put the elephant on a schedule and</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.535" end="01:05:37.335" style="s2">don&#39;t force him to practice just because</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.935" end="01:05:39.335" style="s2">there are more people here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.335" end="01:05:42.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done for today.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.335" end="01:05:43.735" style="s2">I don&#39;t feel like practicing anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.335" end="01:05:46.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.735" end="01:05:48.135" style="s2">If you don&#39;t want to practice, stop.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.435" end="01:05:51.235" style="s2">If you came to watch,</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.135" end="01:05:51.235" style="s2">you can try again tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.335" end="01:05:56.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I drove 2 hours from the next city</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.135" end="01:05:57.635" style="s2">just to see him balance on one leg in</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.535" end="01:05:59.135" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.635" end="01:06:01.835" style="s2">Please wait quietly</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.135" end="01:06:03.135" style="s2">and do not bang on the barrier.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.835" end="01:06:07.135" style="s2">Whether the Asian elephant chooses to</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.135" end="01:06:07.135" style="s2">practice today is entirely up to him.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.135" end="01:06:13.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why hasn&#39;t he started yet? The videos</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.035" end="01:06:15.435" style="s2">say he practices every morning.</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.935" end="01:06:16.335" style="s2">We bought tickets specifically to see</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.435" end="01:06:17.835" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.335" end="01:06:19.235" style="s2">You can&#39;t seriously expect us to stand</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.835" end="01:06:21.535" style="s2">here and watch him soak in the pool all</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.235" end="01:06:21.535" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.535" end="01:06:26.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.935" end="01:06:28.135" style="s2">He wants to soak in the water today, so</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.635" end="01:06:31.035" style="s2">today what you get to see is an elephant</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.135" end="01:06:31.035" style="s2">enjoying his pool.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.335" end="01:06:35.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you advertise him as the yoga</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.835" end="01:06:39.135" style="s2">elephant.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.935" end="01:06:39.135" style="s2">That&#39;s what everybody came for.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.735" end="01:06:43.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve shown people that he can do yoga.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.335" end="01:06:45.835" style="s2">We never promised a performance at a</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.735" end="01:06:47.935" style="s2">fixed time every day.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.835" end="01:06:50.635" style="s2">You&#39;re buying admission to a zoo, not a</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.935" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">ticket to a yoga show.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.635" end="01:06:53.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we drove all this way for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.435" end="01:06:55.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Animals aren&#39;t machines you switch on</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.835" end="01:06:56.935" style="s2">for a show.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.535" end="01:06:58.235" style="s2">If he wants to practice, you&#39;re welcome</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.935" end="01:06:59.835" style="s2">to watch.</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.235" end="01:07:02.435" style="s2">If he doesn&#39;t, no ticket gives anyone</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.835" end="01:07:04.635" style="s2">the right to force him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.435" end="01:07:07.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not worried they&#39;ll stop coming</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.635" end="01:07:08.935" style="s2">if they don&#39;t get to see it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.535" end="01:07:10.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selling a few fewer tickets isn&#39;t going</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.935" end="01:07:11.635" style="s2">to kill me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.335" end="01:07:13.135" style="s2">If I forced you to practice just to</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.635" end="01:07:14.935" style="s2">please visitors, how would I be any</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.135" end="01:07:18.035" style="s2">different from Jason Blake?</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.935" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then today I&#39;m going to enjoy my pool.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.035" end="01:07:22.535" style="s2">Whether I feel like practicing tomorrow</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.335" end="01:07:22.936" style="s2">is tomorrow&#39;s problem.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.535" end="01:07:24.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The director&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.936" end="01:07:24.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.135" end="01:07:25.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watching an</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.436" end="01:07:26.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; elephant play in the water is pretty</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.636" end="01:07:27.836" style="s2">fun, too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.936" end="01:07:29.236" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t always have to be a</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.836" end="01:07:29.836" style="s2">performance.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.236" end="01:07:31.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.836" end="01:07:33.036" style="s2">he&#39;s washing himself with his trunk.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.736" end="01:07:35.736" style="s2">He&#39;s even bigger than he looked in the</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.036" end="01:07:35.736" style="s2">videos.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.536" end="01:07:42.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought we&#39;d get complaints, but</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.236" end="01:07:44.036" style="s2">people online are actually praising us.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.336" end="01:07:45.236" style="s2">Maybe what keeps a zoo alive in the long</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.036" end="01:07:47.636" style="s2">run</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.236" end="01:07:49.736" style="s2">was never one gimmick after another.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.636" end="01:07:52.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is mostly fine,</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.736" end="01:07:53.336" style="s2">but if I&#39;m going to live here long term,</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.336" end="01:07:56.136" style="s2">there are a few things you should</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.336" end="01:07:57.336" style="s2">probably change.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.136" end="01:08:00.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been here a few days and you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.336" end="01:08:01.936" style="s2">already filing renovation requests.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.436" end="01:08:03.036" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s hear them.</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.936" end="01:08:04.536" style="s2">What don&#39;t you like?</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.036" end="01:08:06.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;d be better to clear another patch of</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.536" end="01:08:08.236" style="s2">lawn over there. The morning sun comes</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.736" end="01:08:10.236" style="s2">from that direction, so it&#39;s perfect for</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.236" end="01:08:12.736" style="s2">practice.</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.236" end="01:08:14.336" style="s2">The pool is a little small, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.736" end="01:08:15.836" style="s2">When I lie all the way down, I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.336" end="01:08:17.936" style="s2">stretch my legs.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.836" end="01:08:19.636" style="s2">It should be widened.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.936" end="01:08:21.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you living in a zoo</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.636" end="01:08:22.536" style="s2">or opening a resort?</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.336" end="01:08:24.836" style="s2">Want me to start serving you breakfast,</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.536" end="01:08:24.836" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.036" end="01:08:30.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your environment affects your body,</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.536" end="01:08:32.036" style="s2">and your body affects your mood.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:34.102" style="s2">Being comfortable is part of being</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.036" end="01:08:35.636" style="s2">healthy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.102" end="01:08:36.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.636" end="01:08:37.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the construction manager over here</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.936" end="01:08:40.236" style="s2">and bring me the budget for these</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.936" end="01:08:42.736" style="s2">upgrades.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.236" end="01:08:44.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can expand the lawn and the pool, but</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.736" end="01:08:46.336" style="s2">we&#39;ll need to modify the drainage,</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.336" end="01:08:47.336" style="s2">barriers, and ground surface at the same</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.336" end="01:08:49.136" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.336" end="01:08:50.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Expand the east lawn,</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.136" end="01:08:52.636" style="s2">widen the pool,</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.536" end="01:08:55.436" style="s2">add a non-slip padded area, and upgrade</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.636" end="01:08:57.336" style="s2">the shade zone, too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.436" end="01:08:59.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of that will cost at least several</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.336" end="01:09:01.336" style="s2">hundred thousand dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.436" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I brought him here, I can&#39;t expect</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.336" end="01:09:06.836" style="s2">him to just make do forever. Money that</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.336" end="01:09:08.036" style="s2">needs to be spent shouldn&#39;t be saved.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.836" end="01:09:09.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.036" end="01:09:10.836" style="s2">This place</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.336" end="01:09:12.136" style="s2">is starting to feel more and more like</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.836" end="01:09:13.536" style="s2">somewhere I could actually live long</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.136" end="01:09:15.436" style="s2">term.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.536" end="01:09:16.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t thank me yet. If you start tearing</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.436" end="01:09:18.936" style="s2">things apart with that trunk after the</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.836" end="01:09:21.736" style="s2">renovation, I&#39;m taking the repair bill</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.936" end="01:09:24.236" style="s2">out of your food budget.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.736" end="01:09:26.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m making reasonable requests. I I</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.236" end="01:09:29.438" style="s2">wreck the place.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.338" end="01:09:29.438" style="s2">Do you think I&#39;m the kangaroo?</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.838" end="01:09:33.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today we&#39;re not talking about visitors</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.137" end="01:09:35.538" style="s2">or revenue.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.438" end="01:09:37.038" style="s2">We&#39;re rewriting the management rules.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.538" end="01:09:39.338" style="s2">Starting now, this zoo will no longer</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.038" end="01:09:40.538" style="s2">allow any forced animal performances.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.338" end="01:09:41.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A lot of visitors come specifically for</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.538" end="01:09:43.438" style="s2">the kangaroo&#39;s martial arts and the</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.737" end="01:09:45.637" style="s2">Asian elephant. If we stop scheduling</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.438" end="01:09:47.137" style="s2">them, won&#39;t it hurt attendance?</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.637" end="01:09:49.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If an animal wants to do something,</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.137" end="01:09:51.137" style="s2">visitors can watch. If it doesn&#39;t, it</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.637" end="01:09:52.438" style="s2">rests.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.137" end="01:09:55.438" style="s2">We are not turning their lives into a</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.438" end="01:09:57.038" style="s2">show schedule. Record food, sleep, mood,</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.438" end="01:09:58.238" style="s2">unusual movements, and environmental</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.038" end="01:10:00.438" style="s2">changes.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.238" end="01:10:02.637" style="s2">When an animal has a problem, we look at</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.438" end="01:10:04.438" style="s2">physical, environmental, and emotional</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.637" end="01:10:05.838" style="s2">causes first, then decide how to</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.438" end="01:10:07.838" style="s2">respond.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.838" end="01:10:09.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if visitors pay to come in, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.838" end="01:10:10.838" style="s2">see the activity they wanted, and demand</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.538" end="01:10:12.738" style="s2">a refund?</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.838" end="01:10:14.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re putting this sign up, and from now</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.738" end="01:10:16.438" style="s2">on, we have to mean it. Rules aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.738" end="01:10:18.938" style="s2">decoration for a wall.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.438" end="01:10:20.838" style="s2">They matter when an animal says no,</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.938" end="01:10:22.838" style="s2">and we&#39;re willing to listen.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.838" end="01:10:24.538" style="s2">This starts with us.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.838" end="01:10:26.538" style="s2">From now on, anyone who crosses that</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.538" end="01:10:29.538" style="s2">line just because it&#39;s convenient</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.538" end="01:10:29.538" style="s2">will answer to me first.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
